śrīsundaragaṇapataye namaḥ 
{vātule nityārcanapaṭalaḥ} (- re27521 )


hariḥ om vāsanārcanai

vakṣye nityārcanaṃ puṇyaṃ śubhadaṃ pāpanāśanam| <f.1a> 
mahāpātakadoṣaghnaṃ sarva yajñaphalapradam|| 
ātmārthañcā parārthañcā pūjā dvividhamucyate|
datte ca guruṇāliṅge sthaṇḍile svayamātmanī|| 
saikataṃ taṇḍulaṃ caiva nadīmṛt vānna gomayam|
navanītaṃ ca rudrākṣaṃ piṣṭha candana kūrcakam|| 
puṣpamālā jalaṃ bhasmaṃ ṣoḍaśā kṣaṇaliṅgakāḥ|
kṣaṇike maṇḍale toye cātmārtha yajanaṃ smṛtam|| 
śailajaṃ ratnajaṃ caiva lohajaṃ dārujaṃ tathā| 
mṛṇmayaṃ kṣaṇikañcaiva ṣaḍvidhaṃ liṅgamucyate||
sarveṣāṃ rakṣaṇārthaṃ tu grāmādiṣu viśeṣataḥ| 
sthapitaṃ vidhinā liṅgaṃ surairvāmunibhirnaraiḥ|| <f.1b> 
svayamudbhūtaliṅgañcā pratimañceśvarātmakam|
tatparārthaṃ samākhyātaṃ sarveṣāmatmanaḥ phalam|| 
viprakṣatriyaviṭśūdrāḥ dīkṣitāśca praveśakāḥ|
ātmārtha yajanaṃ kuryāt nakuryāttu parārthakam|| 
ādiśaivena kartavyaṃ cātmārthañca parārthakam| 
ādiśaivamiti lproktaṃ saśivat brahmaṇo guruḥ||
ādiśaiva śivorudro śuddhātmā śuddhaśaivakaḥ| 
tasmāśśaivaṃ prakartavyaṃ pratiṣṭhādyutsavāntakam||
ātmārthañca parārthañca śuddhaśaivārcanasyatu| 
ātmaśuddhistu pūrvaṃ syāt sthānaśuddhirdvitīyakam|| 
tritīyaṃ dravyaśuddhisyāt caturthaṃ mantraśodhanam|
pañcamaṃ liṅgaśuddhisyāt ityete pañca śuddhayaḥ|| <f.2a> 
vidhinā snānaṃ kṛtvātu dehaśuddhiṃ tataḥ param|
pādaprakṣālanaṃ  kṛtvā ācamya vidhinā budhaḥ|| 
uttarābhimukhobhūtvā rucirāsana saṃssthitaḥ|
padmañca svastikaṃ caiva gomukhaṃ viṃśatiṃ tathā|| 
sucīca ekapādaṃ tu kukkuṭaṃ vīrameva ca|
bhadrāsanaṃ tathā jñeyaṃ kūrmaṃ vimalameva ca|| 
daṇḍaṃ piṇḍaṃ ca gokarṇaṃ sihmāsanamataḥ param| 
vṛttaṃ caitghaṭikañcaiva gajasthaṃ gajakarṇikam||
āsanaṃ viṃśatiḥ proktaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ sthira sukhāsanam|
ūru jānudvayañcaiva pādāgraścaiva saṃpuṭam||
īśannāsāgra dṛṣṭistu dehadīrghaṃ tadadrajam| 
rucirāsanamākhyātaṃ sarvakāryeṣu pūjitam|| <f.2b>
gomukhaṃ svastikañcaiva padmaṃ caivārdha candrakam|
vīraṃ yogāsanaṃ proktaṃ ṣaḍvidhaṃ cāsanaṃ tataḥ|| 
vāmajānuparinyastvā dakṣiṇaṃ jānu maṇḍalam|
dvayoḥ pādatalecaiva vinyaset pārśva pṛṣṭhayoḥ|| 
evaṃ kṛtvātu susnigdhaṃ gomukhaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ smṛtam|
ūrū pārśva talau nyastvā padmāsanamihocyate|| 
ūrū pārśva talaunyastvā jaṅghā magnau tu svastikam| 
ūrūpari talau nyastvā dvayoḥ pārśva taleṣu ca||
gulphadvaya samaṃ kṛtvā talau jaṅghe ca vinyaset| 
ardhacandra samākhyātaṃ vīrāsanaṃ tadaśṛṇu||
lambitaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ pādaṃ vāmadakṣiṇatopari| 
sthiravīrāsanaṃ proktaṃ yogāsanaṃ tadaśṛṇu||
śarīraṃ jānu saṃbandhaṃ yogapaṭṭikayāvṛtam| <f.3a>
korpare caiva vinyasthau yogāsanamihocyate|| 
kūrmadarbhaṃ tathā carmā māsanaṃ ruciraṃ tathā|
daśadikṣvastra mantreṇa digvirecanamārabhet||
prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā pratyekaṃ daśamātrakam| 
apāno jivvati prāṇaṃ prāṇāt praṇavamucyate||  
prāṇāpānasamāyogāt prāṇāyāmeti cocyate|
recakaṃ pūrakaṃ caiva kumbhakaṃ ca tritīyakam|| 
recanādrecanaṃ  proktaṃ pūraṇāt pūrakaṃ tathā|
kumbhakaṃ stannirodhena praṇavenāllise trayam||
recakaṃ brahmadaivatyaṃ pūrakaṃ viṣṇu daivatam| 
kumbhakaṃ rudra daivatyaṃ adhidevāḥ prakīrtitāḥ||
akā ukā makāraśca prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ viduḥ| <f.3b>
ukāraṃ somarūpaṃ tu pūrakāditya saṃkhyayā||
makārasyārkarūpaṃ tu kalā saṃkhyasya kumbhakam|
akārasyāgni rūpaṃ tu vāyu saṃkhyasya recakam|| 
prathamaṃ vāmanāḍyena dvitīyaṃ savya nāḍikā|
punastritīyena(yaṃ) vāmena prāṇāyāmakataṃ(kṛtaṃ/kramaṃ) tathā|| 
udaraṃ vāyumaṅgalyaṃ nāsikāṃ pīḍya recayet|
dṛtivat pūrayet saṃyak jaṭhare bāhyavāyunā||
pūraketu samākhyātaṃ tasmāt kumbhakamucyate| 
antarbahisthitaṃ vāyuṃ nagrahṇāti namuñcati||
tasmāttu kumbhakaṃ yasmāt tasmāt kumbhakamucyate| <f.4a>
prāṇāyāmāt paraṃ puṇyaṃ nabhūto nabhaviṣyati||
pādādi jānuparyantaṃ pṛthivī sthānamucyate| 
ambhasthānaṃ tu nābhyantaṃ vahnisthānaṃ galāntakam||
vāyusthānaṃ lalāṭetu tadūrdhve dvādaśāṅgulam| 
ākāśasthānamityuktaṃ ūrvyā(rdhvā)disthāna pañcakam||
tālamātraṃ lalāṭetu tadūrdhve dvādaśāṅgulam| 
śivasthānamiti proktaṃ pramāṇaṃ tu tathaiva ca||
śivatatvamidaṃ guhyamākāśasthānamucyate| 
caturaśrārdhacandraṃ ca trikoṇaṃ ca ṣaḍaśrakam||
suvṛttaṃ ca pṛthivyādi maṇḍalākṛtayaṃ kramāt| 
pītaṃ śuklaṃ tathā raktaṃ kṛṣṇā dhūmrāhi varṇakam||
tathorvyādīni varṇāni la(-)va(-)ra(-)ya(-)hakārakāḥ| <f.4b>
pṛthivyādīni bījāni brahmādyāḥ pañcamūrtayaḥ||
brahmā viṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ| 
adhidevāssamākhyātāścorvyādīnāṃ yathā kramam||
hṛcchiracchūlikā mantraiḥ varma mantreṇa buddhimān|
pṛthivyādīni bījāni yojayettu krameṇatu|| 
pañcetvyātāścatasraśca trayaśca dvayamekaśaḥ|
pāśupatena śāstreṇa pañcagranthistu ścedayet|| 
pañcagranthiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā tasmāt prakṛti niścayam|
jānu granthistu prathamaṃ nābhigranthi dvitīyakam|| 
galagranthistritīyaṃ tu lalāṭetu caturthakam|
brahmagranthistu pañcaite pañcagranthimitismṛtam|| <f.5a>
hṛdgalaṃ tālubhrūmadhye brahmagranthistu pañcamam|
athavānya prakāreṇa pañcagranthiṃ vidhīyate|| 
pañcagranthiṃ tathā ścedyā ātmayojaṃ vidhīyate|
mūrtimantreṇa sa(..)hya jīvahuṃkāra mūrdhniṣu|| 
kumbhakena samākhyātaṃ vāyumūrtigatā nyaset|
tenaiva dvādaśāntasthe śivena saha yojayet|| 
ātmayojaname tasyā tato bhṛtāni śodhayet|
pṛthivyādau payovahni dvau dvau śodhya parasparam|| 
ākāśena viroyena yathāśuddhiṃ taducyate| 
nivṛtyādīni bhūtāni tānyadhvāni samastakam||
vyāpya vyavasthitā tāni manyaitāni viśodhayet| 
dahanaṃ pātabhūtānāṃ parasparaṃ viśodhanam||
maṇḍalādi samākhyātaṃ bhūtaśuddhirihoditam| <f.5b>
śodhyoparāga rahitaṃ kālamātra vyavasthitam||
vicintya divyadehārtham amṛtāplāvanānnayet| 
dhyātvā kuṇḍalinī śaktīmamṛteka svarūpiṇī||
tadudbhūtāmṛtaśrāve siktābhūta layāsmṛtām| 
kṛtvā hṛdyasanaṃ tasmin mūrtyātmānaṃ samācaret||
punarāplāvanaṃ kṛtvā karanyāsaṃ samācaret| 
nābhautu caturaṅgulyam adhasthādagni maṇḍalam||
kadambapuṣpavadvarṇam aṣṭapatraṃ trikoṇakam| 
mūlādhāramayaṃ proktaṃ dvitīyaṃ nābhimūlake||
bhujaṅgapala pākāramaṣavartulameva ca|
kuṇḍalākha mahānāḍī bhānumaṇḍalamucyate||
ātmānaṃ grahya saṃhāraṃ mudrayā vigrahānvitam| 
pañcātmāna vidhānena dehādīntat pramāṇataḥ|| <f.6a>     
ātmānañcāntarātmānaṃ paramātmānameva ca |
tatvātmā devabhūtātmā ātmabhūtaṃ praśasyate ||
ātmānaṃ daṇḍamadhyastham antarātmā tadantaram | 
paramātmāvamadhyasthaṃ tatvātmā pārśvadakṣiṇam ||
bhūtātmā pāvapārśvetu pañcātmāsthānamucyate | 
iḍāpiṅgasuṣumnā ca trividhātmā sthitauyutaḥ ||
pañcātmā sthānamevoktaṃ pārśvamadhyetu dauhitam | 
ātmānaṃ guṇasaṃproktam antarātmasya tāmasam ||
paramātmā paraṃ dhyātvā tatvātmā rājatomukham | 
bhūtakāma kriyā caiva āhāro jāyate'ti ca || 
sukhaduḥkhasya carita visarjamaiyunasya ca |
anyeṣu bhūtakānyātmā bhūtātmā guṇamāvaham || 
ityete cātmamityuktaṃ pūjākāleṣu durlabham |
akārātmānamityāhurntarātma makārakam ||
oṃ kāraṃ paramātmānaṃ tatvātmā vai ukārakam |
ekāraṃ sarvabhūtātmā akṣaraṃ saṃprakīrtitam || <f.6b>
bhūtātmā yojayedvidvān antarātmā dahetpunaḥ | 
tatvātmā amṛtaṃ pūryā śuddhātmā ānayet punaḥ ||
śikhāgre vyomake śuddhe śivatatve niyojayet | 
kṛtvākāyaṃ dahet paścāt yātenaiva trikoṇakam ||
pādāṅguṣṭāt samārabhya daheprāśvacchirontakam | 
jvālāmālā samāyuktaṃ śarīraṃ daṇḍarajjuvat || 
prakriyāntakamamṛtaṃ sravantaṃ cintayet sadā |
praṇavaṃ śvetakamalaṃ yogapīṭhamadhomukham || 
cintayedmṛtaṃ tasmin  suṣumnā bhinnamasthakam |
āpūryantu tato dhyāyedātmānamamṛte na ca || 
ātmānamānayeddhīmān evaṃ śivamanukramāt |
śikhāgre dvādaśāṅgulye vīṇādaṇḍasya pārśvayoḥ ||
suṣumnā madhyatanmadhye madhyetu suṣiraṃ tathā | <f. 6a (2))
jīvapramāṇa saṃyukte teṣumadhyetu sañcaret ||
sañcāre duhitatkāle ādhāreṣuca saṃsthitiḥ | 
ādheyaṃ yaḥ prayuktañca samādhikyevamāśṛtam ||
iḍāpiṅgalayormadhye vīṇādaṇḍasya pārśvayoḥ | 
mūlādhāre smaredagniṃ candrasūrya samanvitam || 
kuṇḍalāntu vidhātāraṃ nābhau mudāhṛtam |
hṛdaye kevalaṃ(?) rudraṃ kaṇṭhamūle maheśvaram || 
jihvāmūletu sādākhyaṃ nāsāgre bindureva ca |
nādākhyā bhruvamadhyetu lalāṭe śakti saṃjñakam || <f. 6b (2) blank) <f.7a>
brahmarandhre śivaṃ vidyāt ūrdhve nṛttaṃ vicintayet |
dvādaśāntāt paraṃ yasmāt atisūkṣmo stitāṃ viduḥ || 
ānandanṛttakaṃ sākṣāt devadevo jagadgurum | 
śuklaśroṇitayormadhye bindurūpaṃ parātparam ||
tasyamadhyegataṃ prāṇo bindunādātmakaṃ śivaḥ | 
evaṃ kṛtvā viśeṣaṃ tu athavānyakramaṃ śṛṇu ||
gudasya pṛṣṭhabhāgetu tadūrdhve dviti(tī)yāṅgulam | 
vīṇādaṇḍasya sambandhāt kadambadalapadmakam || 
mūlādhāresmarecaivā candrasūryasamanvitam |
tasyamadhyetu sambandhāt śivāgniṃ paramāṇukam || 
rūpamadhye sthitaṃ vāyurvāyumadhye sthito manaḥ |
manomadhye sthito nāma nāmamadhye sthita dhvaniḥ || <f.7b> 
dhvanimadhye sthito nādaṃ nādamadhye sthitaṃ śivaḥ |
śivamadhye gataṃ śāntaṃ śāntyātītaṃ parātparam || 
parātparataraṃ śāntam ityete śivabhāvayoḥ |
prathamaṃ tu karanyāsamaṅganyāsamataḥ param || 
śodhayedastramantreṇa sthalikau hastha (sta) pṛṣṭakau |
astreṇa huṃphaḍantena dvirvāmaṃ śodhayet karam || 
kareṇa pāṇinā sarvevyapāmahasteka saṃsmṛtam | 
vāmahasthe (ste) jalaṃ sthāpya agnihasthaṃ (staṃ) tu dakṣiṇam ||
agnimmalastha śodhena karanyāsa samanvitam | 
aṅguṣṭādi kaniṣṭāntaṃ sṛṣṭinyāsamudāhṛtam ||
kaniṣṭādyaṅguṣṭa paryantaṃ saṃhāranyāsamucyate | 
īśānādīni sadyāntaṃ sṛṣṭinyāsamudāhṛtam ||
sadyādīśāna paryantaṃ saṃhāranyāsamucyate | <f.8a>
dakṣiṇāṅguṣṭamādisyāt kaniṣṭādītare tataḥ || 
daśabījaṃ nyaseddhīmān sthitinyāsamidaṃ(?)param |
tarjanyāntantu madhyādi kramādaṅgāni vinyaset || 
nyaseddhasta tale netraṃ tarjanyāmastrakaṃ nyaset |
śivāṅgānevamevaṃ syāt śivaṃ parvaṇi parvaṇi || 
gṛhastha sṛṣṭimārgeṇa karanyāsaṃ tu kārayet |
vānaprastha yadī(tī)nāñca saṃhāra kramameva hi || 
apatnikopanasthaścet saṃhāranyāsamucyate |
naiṣṭiketu sthitinyāsaṃ sarvakāryeṣu pūjitam || 
karanyāsaṃ samākhyātamaṅganyāsamataḥ param | 
mūrdhādi sṛṣṭiraḥ prokataṃ pādādi saṃhṛdirbhavet ||
svasvamūrdhni nyasedīśaṃ vaktre vaktraṃ tu vinyaset | <f.8b>
nyastvā ghoraṃ hṛdisthāne vāmāṅguhyetu vinyaset ||
sadyamantraṃ nyaset pādau tatasthaṅgāni vinyaset | 
hṛdayaṃ hṛdaye nyasya śiraśśirasi vinyaset ||
śikhāṃ śikhāyāṃ vinyasya kavacaṃ sthanamadhyataḥ | 
locanetu nyasennetram astraṃ hasthapradeśake |
aṣṭatriṃśat kalānyāsaṃ vidhinā kārayettataḥ || 
utsṛjya prākṛtaṃ bhāvaṃl śivo'hamitibhāvayet | 
evaṃ kṛtvā viśeṣeṇa antaryāgaṃ samācaret ||
nābhicakraṃ samāśṛtyā kārayedvahnimaṇḍalam | 
hṛdaye dhārayet somaṃ bhūmadhye ravimaṇḍalam || 
hṛdaye yajanaṃ kuryāt somaṃ nābhau prakalpayet |
tathaiśvaraṃ tu bhūmadhye dhyāyet sarvagataṃ prabhum || <f.9a>
pañcāvaraṇamārgeṇā pūjayitvā viśeṣataḥ |
hṛtpadmecārcayennityaṃ trikālaṃ vā dvikālakam || 
athavā ekakālaṃ vā saṃyajenmānasena tu |
ātmaśuddhiridaṃ proktaṃ sthānaśuddhiṃ tataḥ śṛṇu || 
śivāgre sthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā hastamātra pramāṇataḥ |
āvāhayettato bhūmiṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām || 
dvibhujā ca dvinetrāñca karaṇḍamakuṭānvitām | 
hemayajñopavītañca pītanetrāṃ suyauvanām ||
pītābhāṃ pītavaktrāñca puṇḍarīkadalekṣaṇām | 
kṛtāñjalipuṭāñcaivotpalāmambikaṃ tu vā ||
bhūmidevisvarūpāyāṃ sarvāvayavasundarīm |
gandhādibhissamabhyarca hṛdaye naiva mantrataḥ || <f.9b>
astreṇaivatu mantreṇa digvirecanamārabhet |
sthānaśuddhiridaṃ proktaṃ dravyaśuddhiṃ tataśśṛṇu || 
śarāvaṃ pādyapātraṃ ca śaṅkhamācamanīyakam |
jalabhāṇḍaṃ vardhanīñca puṣpapātrārghya pātrakam || 
astreṇākṣālayeddhīmān nirīkṣya hṛdayenatu |
kavacenāvakuṇṭhyā'tha tenaivonmīlanaṃ kuru || 
vardhanīṃ caiva śaṅkhaṃ ca pūrayettu śivāmbhasā | 
pañcabrahma ṣaḍaṅgāni toyamadhyetu vinyaset ||
vidhāya dakṣahastena daśabījaṃ nyasettataḥ | 
darśayelliṅgamudrāṃ tu padmamudrāṃ pradarśayet ||
pātrāṇi vyāhṛdi prokṣya śaṅkhatoyena sarvaśaḥ | <f.10a>
kṣīraṃ dadhi ghṛtādīṃśca gandhapuṣpañca dhūpakam ||
vardhanyā teyamādāya prokṣayet puruṣeṇa tu | 
dravyaśuddhirbhavedevaṃ liṅgaśuddhiṃ tata śṛṇu || 
devadevaṃ namaskṛtvā dvāradevān supūjayet |
padaṅgordhve gaṇeśantu dakṣiṇe saṃprapūjayet || 
gajānanaṃ triṇetrastu śyāmavarṇañcaturbhujam |
laḍḍukaṃ paraśuṃ vāme savye dantākṣamālikam || 
nāgayajñopavītañca sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām |
pataṅga vāmapārśvetu sarasvatī saṃprapūjayet || 
abhayaṃ varadañcaiva gaṇḍikāṃ vāmahastake | 
savyepadmasya saṃyuktaṃ mathavācaiva dhārayet || 
sarvalakṣaṇa saṃyuktaṃ bāhyāḥ pūjāṃ samācaret | <f. 10b>
padaṅgordhve gaṇeśaṃ tu śrīdevyāṃ tasya vāmake ||
dvibhujāñca dvinetrāñca saratnamakuṭānvitām | 
pītavarṇa samāyuktāṃ sarvāvaya sundarīm ||
paṅkajaṃ dakṣiṇe hasthe (ste) śrīphalaṃ vāmahastha(sta>ke | 
padmamadhyesthitaṃ (tāṃ) devīṃ hastadvayadvipārśvayoḥ ||
ūrdhva hastapaṭopetamabhiṣekasṛvaṃstritam |
śvedahasti samāyuktaṃ śrīdevīṃ saṃprapūjayet || 
dakṣahasthe bhuvaṅgasya nandinaṃ raktavarṇakam |
triṇetrañcaturbhujañcaiva abhayaṃ varadānvitam || 
ugratomaraśūlañca akṣamālāsamanvitam |  
tasyaiva vāmapārśvetu dvinetraṃ dvibhujaṃ tathā || 
gaṅgāyā śuklavarṇantu makarārūḍhasaṃyutam |
nīlotpalaṃ dakṣiṇe haste pūrṇakumbhaṃ tu vāmake || <f.11a>
citravastrasamāyuktaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam |
dvārasya dakṣiṇe pārśve nandīṃ gaṅgāṃ supūjayet || 
vāme caiva bhuvaṅgasya mahākālaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇakam |
caturbhujaṃ triṇetrañca kapālaṃ śūlameva ca | 
dakṣiṇe'bhaya ṭaṅkasyā vāme pāśa samanvitam ||
jaṭāmakuṭa saṃyuktaṃ nāgayajñopavītakam | 
tasya dakṣiṇa pārśvetu yamunāñcaiva kārayet || 
dvibhujāñca dvinetrāñca śyāmavarṇa samanvitam |
kūrmāsana samāyuktaṃ sarvābharaṇa bhūṣitam || 
pūrṇakumbhasya vāmetu utpalaṃ savyahastake |
yamunāñca svarūpantu sarvāvayava sundarīm || 
dvārasya vāmapārśvetu mahākālamunāṃsthitām |
yamunāñca mahākālaṃ tasya vāme supūjayet || <f. 11b>
vimalāñca subāhuñca pūjayettu kavāṭayoḥ | 
paṭṭikāṃ skandamabhyarcya valayaṃ sūryasomayoḥ ||
suṣire navaśaktiśca astrāṇāmādharaṃ vrajet | 
vṛṣabhaṃ pūjayedagre gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ kramāt || 
antarmaṇḍalakañcaiva prathamaṃ saṃprapūjayet | 
antarhāradvitīyaṃ tu madhyahāraṃ tritīyakam ||  
maryādīnāñcaturthaṃ tu mahāmaryādi pañcakam |
pañcaprākāramevoktaṃ prakāre balimācaret || 
garbhagrahasya dvārevā athavā ardhamaṇṭhape |
athavā maṇṭhapasyeva uttamāmadhyamādhamā || 
tadvāre dvārapālaṃ tu āsīnaṃ vā sthitaṃ tu vā |
ḍiṇḍinaṃ(?) savya pārśvetu muṇḍinaṃ vāmapārśvake || <f.12a> 
raktavarṇaṃ dvinetrañca nāgayajñopavītakam | 
bhīmarūpaṃ sudaṃṣṭrañca dvibhujāmekavaktrakam ||
vismayaṃ hastasaṃyuktaṃ daṇḍāyudha samanvitam | 
savyapārśvesthitaṃ devaṃ ḍiṇḍināṃ tu svarūpakam ||
muṇḍinaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ tu dvibhujañca dvinetrakam | 
daṇḍāyudhasamāyuktaṃ nāgābharaṇabhūṣitam |
vismayaṃ hastasaṃyuktaṃ muṇḍinaṃ tu svarūpakam || 
pūrvato vasato rudraṃ pūrvatadvārapālakaḥ |
pratyaṅmukhastathā kuryāt pūjākāle viśeṣataḥ || 
pūjānte pūrvavatkṛtvā dvārapālaṃ tathaiva ca |
ghaṇṭā tu tāḍayeddhīmān astramantraṃ samuccaran || 
pūjākāletu ghaṇṭātu tāḍanaṃ kṣiprayojanam | 
asurārākṣasāścaiva gamanaṃ dūratastathā || 
āvāhane ca pūjānte visṛjyārghyaṃ suyojayet | <f.12b>
arghyaṃ vilepane snātā triṣugandhaṃ suyojayet ||
abhiṣeke ca dhūpe ca nevede balikarmaṇi | 
visarjaneva māpnoti mahāghaṇṭāṃ prahārayet ||
arcanādi kriyākāle pracchinnapaṭamuttamam | 
pāparogi parabhraṣṭā nāstikaiśśivanindakaiḥ ||
durmukhasya durācāro mūrkhasya gurunindakaḥ | 
vedavikriyaviprāṇāṃ nāsthināṃ bhaktihīnakaḥ || 
cakramakṣarakañcaiva adi(dī)kṣitasya dhurtakaḥ |
praviśya darśanaṃ kṛtvā pūjāhīnaṃ tu niṣphalam || 
pracchannapaṭa saṅkalpya sarvadoṣa nikṛntanam |
apanīrya yavanikāṃ hṛdimantraṃ samuccaran || 
garbhagehaṃ tataḥ prāpya liṅgaśuddhiṃ samācaret |
svayambhurdevikaṃ bāṇaṃ gāṇapañcārṣakaṃ tathā || <f. 13a>
śiṣṭaliṅgamitikhyātaṃ pūjāpūrvavadācaret |
āvāhodvāsanannāsti śiṣṭaliṅgaṃ viśeṣataḥ || 
sūtrahīnaṃ tu yalliṅgaṃ mūrdhni madhye tu vinyaset |
sarvatravyāpinaṃ devaṃ parameśaṃ sadāśivam || 
abhimukhīkaraṇaṃ yaśca tadāvāhanamucyate |
vimukhīkaraṇaṃ yattatatodvāsanamucyate || 
pūjā parisamāptau tu vimukhītadvisarjanam |
yathā kuṇḍagatasyāgnau vāyunā jvalitaṃ(?) bhavet ||
tathā ca liṅgamātreṇa jāyate bhagavān śivaḥ | 
devaiśca munibhiścaiva paśūnāṃ(?)pakṣijālakam ||
mṛgāṇāgāṇavañcaiva svayambhūśca viśeṣataḥ | 
yakṣarādyādikaścaiva talliṅgaṃ tu pratiṣṭhitam || <f. 13b>
tacchiṣṭaṃ liṅgamityuktaṃ śivasānnidhya kāraṇam |
tasmādāvāhanaṃ nāsti nacaivodvāsana kriyā || 
kuta āvāhanaṃ devaṃ kuto'trodvāsanaṃ tataḥ |
surāṇāñcaiva devānāṃ vismaranti visarjanam ||
liṅgamāvāhanaṃ caiva liṅgamūrtiritismṛtam | 
ācārya sannidhau kṛtvā darpaṇaścādayet kramāt ||
dīpāddīpa sahasrāṇi mūladīpannalipyate | 
yasya devārcanaṃ liṅgaṃ mūlaliṅgaṃ tathaikaśaḥ || 
golatyanekavarṇāni kṣīramekaṃ samudbhavam |
tasmādīśvaramekaṃ tu tatrañca bahurūpakam ||
kulālaścakramṛgdistu nānārūpeṇa dṛśyate | 
ācāryaṃ manasā dhyātvā bahudhā parameśvaram ||
śilāmṛddāru citreṣu devatā yatra kalpitā | <f. 14a>
akalpitasvayaṃ jyotirātmane devatādhikam ||
kāṣṭādagni ghaṭe candre spiśa māvāhayettataḥ | 
yaddevamarcayāni tutaddevamātmano bhavet || 
mūlādi dvādaśāntaṃ tu mantraṃ prāsādamuccaran | 
kṛtvāñjaliṃ puṭomantri gandhapuṣpeṇa yojayet || 
bhaktyā niṣkala gocaraṃ samarasībhāvaṃ gataḥ |
śaktyāntañcaiva nādāntaṃ niṣkatāntaṃ kūtasvajit || 
bhāvane devamāvāhya mantravāsaparaṃ śṛṇu |
mantrāṇāṃ prakṛtirvāsu vāsanāṃ prakṛtistathā || 
prakṛtīvāhavāhaṃ tu varṇāvāsyañcajaṃ yathā |
nāsyavāpyañca asyañca asyavāsyañca buddhinā || 
buddhināṃ(?)hṛdayevāsaṃ hṛdayaṃ piṇḍavāsane | <f. 14b>
piṇḍānāṃ vāsanaṃ nāḍi nāḍīnāṃ pāyuvāsanam ||
vāyuvāsaṃ ca śaktīnāṃ śaktyāvāsañcamevaca | 
śiva vāsaṃ a sarveṣāṃ mantravāsaṃ prakīrtitam ||
mantravāsamidaṃ proktaṃ mantrāvāhanamucyate | 
liṅge ca pratime kumbhe vāstumagniñca mūlake ||
anye ca kumbhakārye ca yuktaṃ mantrasya(syā)vāhanam | 
sūtrahīnaṃ tu yalliṅgaṃ mūrdhni madhye tu vinyaset |
yāvadvāramukhaṃ(?)liṅgaṃ tadvaktraṃ bhāvayeguhā || 
sūtrāgretu mukhaṃ vṛddhi sūtra pārśvetu bāhukau |
sūtrāyāḥ pādamevaṃ syāt sūtrasadhyastu pṛṣṭataḥ || 
pūrvasadhyārcitaṃ puṣpam īśānena visarjaya(ye)t | 
kaniṣṭānāmikāmadhye puṣpaṃ(?)grāhya vicakṣaṇaḥ ||
aṅguṣṭatarjanībhyāntu puṣpadaṃ paryutatyajet | <f. 15a> 
visarjane tu tatkāle puṣpamūrdhniṣu dāpayet ||
pūjā paryuṣitaṃ sarvaṃ caṇḍeśāya nivedayet | 
kṣālayelliṅgamastreṇa dakṣapāṇitalevai || 
pīṭhaṃ pāśupatāstreṇa kṣālayet paritaḥ kramāt |
nirmālyaṃ visarjayitvā tu liṅgapīṭhañca vāriṇā || 
śodhanaṃ kṣālanañcaiva liṅgaśuddhiṃ prakīrtitāḥ |
śivadvādaśamevaṃ tu tasmādasyaiva bhārakam || 
tadvṛddhiñcaikabhāraṃ tu daśabhāramitismṛtam |
pūrvāhne pañcabhāraṃ tu madhyāhne daśabhārakam || 
dvibhārañcaiva sāyāhne ekabhāraṃ tu sārdhake |
upasandhyopasandhyaintu cāṣṭabhāramitismṛtam ||
eteṣāmiti saṅkhaistu snānadravyamiti śṛṇu | <f. 15b>
elālavaṅgakarpūraṃ candanāgarupātrakam ||
tatkolañcaiva kaccolaṃ uśirañcampakaṃ tathā | 
hariverañca sarveṣāṃ snānadravyamitismṛtam ||
liṅgotsedhaṃ caturmānam ekāmśaṃ vastraveṣṭitam | 
dvayāmśaṃ bhūṣaṇairyuktam ekāmśaṃ puṣpaśobhitam || 
mānahīne mahāvyādhiradhike śatṛvardhanam | 
tasmāt samamidaṃ proktaṃ sarvagandhānulepanam || 
mantratoyābhiṣekena mantrapuṣpāṇi dāpayet |
mastahasta sadāpuṣpaṃ puṣpāśca mantrarūpakam || 
mantrāśca gandhasaṃyogaṃ mantrapuṣpamitismṛtam |
liṅgaśuddhirbhavedevaṃ mantraśuddhiṃ tataśṛṇu ||
dantāloṣṭaṃ tu sañcāro mantrasyāśaucanirhaṇāt | 
nādāntoccaraṇenaiva mantraśuddhi samīriṇaḥ || <f. 16a> 
madhayeśchabalulitān devatān vācakānaṇūn |
suṣumnā nāḍikoccārācaṇollekhena recayet || 
oṃkārādi namontaṃ tu mantrān sarve viśeṣataḥ |
yajanena prayoktavyaṃ mantraśuddhirudāhṛtam ||(?) 
yo vetti pañcaśuddhistu sapūjāṃ kartumarhasi |
yajane'rkendu sañcāre niṣphalaṃ tadavāpnuyāt || 
candrārkanāśa yajanaṃ sarvasiddhikaraṃ śubham |
urdhvaprāṇasthatā(tathā)ditya adhaprāṇasya candramā || 
tayornirodhanaṃ(?)kuryāt tasya candrārkanāśanam | 
dīparātrau parityajya kathaṃ pūjyena deśikaḥ ||
sarvabhūte manaḥ cakṣuḥ vṛttisthau śaśibhāskarau | 
manasānānyamanasā driṣṭisāṃpūjyate manaḥ ||
driṣṭisāmīkṣaṇannetram anyatraiva prajāpate | <f.16b>
yāvatpūjāṃ samārabhya tāvaccakṣumanogatiḥ ||
nānyekṣaṇān matobhūtvā ye(e)kākṣaraparaṃ tathā | 
tenārcanena deveśam arcanānyamananyathā ||
manaścakṣurdvayovṛddhiḥ(?) yasminkāle dvijottamaḥ | 
ekacittamanaḥ prāpte tasminkāle samarcayet ||
candrārkanāśane kāle tatkālamitikathyate | 
saṅkrānte viṣave pūjā na kartavya kadācanaḥ || 
puṭāt puṭāntaraṃ prāpti tena saṅkrāntirucyate | 
puṭadvayadvipārśvetu saṅkrāntaṃ suṣiraṃ tathā ||
āsyapānadvayañcaiva viṣumevaṃ prakīrtitam | 
visargantaḥ prakartavyaṃ maunaṃ tatsaṃprapūjayet ||
pūrvadvāra samāyuktam agnesthitvātu pūjayet | 
dakṣiṇadvāra samāyuktaṃ naiṛtaṃ tu samarcayet ||
paścimadvārasamāyuktaṃ sthitvā naiṛtamarcayet | <f. 17a>
uttaradvārasaṃyuktaṃ vāyudeśaṃ prapūjayet || 
pūrvetu paścime caiva uttarābhimukhārcayet | 
uttare dakṣiṇe caiva pūrvasyābhimukhārcayet || 
agnau vā niṛtau vā'pi sthitvā devaṃ prapūjayet |
kalaśodaka pūraistu dvayāḥ pāṇiñca saṃpuṭeḥ || 
kalaśaṃ vāmahastena adhomukha dakṣiṇekare |
gośṛṅgāgra pramāṇena liṅgāgrau caturaṅgulam || 
abhiṣekaṃ śanaiḥ kṛtvā mūlamantraṃ samuccaran | 
athavānya prakāreṇā gojalasrayataḥ kramāt ||
pūrakodakapūrakaiḥ kumbhakaiḥ pāṇikumbhakaiḥ | 
recakodaka recakaiḥ liṅgamūrdhni śanaiḥ kramāt ||
pa(ma)ntrādhvāca padādhvā ca varṇādhvā ca purāṇi ca | <f. 17b>
tatvādhvā ca kalādhvā ca japeddevaṃ samarcayet || 
śivamantraṃ samuccārya maunataḥ śivapūjanam |
agra(rdha)maṇṭapadagretu brāhmaṇāṃ vedaghoṣakān || 
adīkṣitaścaturvedi liṅgasparśana varjayet |
dīkṣito bhaktihīnasya rājarāṣṭraṃ vinaśyati || 
dṛṣṭvā mṛgapaticchāyāṃ yatha(thā)bhīte vane gajaḥ |
amantrārcanamaṃ dṛṣṭvā tathā devaṃ bhayaṃ labhet || 
śivadvijakule jāto dīkṣitaśca śivāgame |
pūjayeddevadeveśaṃ śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā || 
āsanaṃ kalpayettatra śivārcanavidhīyate |
ādhāramāsanaṃ proktaṃ kuyeyaṃ paramaśśivaḥ || 
nādaṃ liṅgamitikhyātaṃ bindupīṭhamitismṛtam |
naśivena vinā śaktiḥ naśaktirvigitaśśivaḥ || <f.18a>
puṣpeṣu gandhavat jñeyo tileṣu tailavattathā |
dehe ca pra(prā)ṇavāśśaktiṃ tasmādvidvān prapūjayet || 
śaktirevāsanaṃ proktaṃ pañcāsanaṃ tadā kramāt |
pārcchipāṇḍamathaskandaṃ nālaṃ vahniṃ taducyate || 
tato'nantāsanaṃ pūrvaṃ sihmāsanaṃ dvitīyakam | 
yogāsanaṃ tritīyaṃ tu turyaṃ padmāsanaṃ bhavet ||
pañcamaṃ vimalākhyaṃ tu pañcabhūtātmikastvime | 
vṛttakāramanantaṃ tu sūryakoṭisamaprabham ||
adhastāt kalpayedūrdhve sihmāsanaṃ prakalpayet | 
dharmajñānaṃ tu vairāgyamaiśvaryaṃ ca catuṣṭayam || 
śuklābhaṃ padmarāgañca haimaṃ marataka(kata)prabham |
dharmādīnāṃ tu varṇāsyuḥ āgneyādikrameṇatu || <f.18b>
pāssaścaturthakoṇeṣu siṃharūpeṇa kalpayet |
daṃṣṭrākarāla vadanā triṇetra(trā) bhūmarūpiṇā || 
koṭisiṃhairviśeṣeṇa pratyekaṃ parivārataḥ |
adharmajñānavairāgyamaiśvaryaṃ ca tathaiva ca || 
rājāvartanibhāssarve pra(prā)gādikṣu prakalpayet | 
guṇatrayeṇa santāḍyamevaṃ siṃhāsanaṃ bhavet ||
bhūtarūpeṇa koṇeṣu pādākūta yugādayaḥ | 
śvetaraktaṃ tathā kṛṣṇaṃ pītaṃ ketādivarṇakam ||
avyaktoniyatiḥ kāla kalāśceti catuṣṭayam | 
avyaktasphaṭikābhāso niyatiḥ kāñjanadyutiḥ || 
kālo ḍāḍima puṣpābhaḥ kalābhinnāñjanaprabhā |
prāgādi(..)litā proktā madhyapādastu keśavaḥ || <f. 19a>
evaṃ yogāsanaṃ proktaṃ padmāsanaṃ tado(to)pari |
māyātatvaṃ bṛhat granthi śuddhavidyābjaśobhitam || 
vidyeśvaradalaṃśchannaṃ śaktikesarasaṃyutam | 
vidyātatvamayīṃ tatra karṇikāyāṃ prakalpayet || 
bījaṃ pravālavarṇābham aṅkuraṃ rajataprabham | 
tasya nālaṃ tu vaiḍūryaṃ kaṇṭakaṃ raktapiṅgalam ||
śaṅkhavarṇa dalāgraṃ ca raktācopadalāsmṛtā | 
kiñcillohitapītāni madhyesyuḥ kesarāṇi ca ||
tanmadhye kalpayeddhīmān karṇikāṃ kanakaprabhām | 
navabījāni tanmadhye hemabhāni prakalpayet || 
vāmādi śaktayaścāṣṭau kṣpet sareṣu prakalpayet |
indrādīśāna paryantaṃ nyasenmadhye manonmanīm || <f.19b>
ātmatatvaṃ nyaset sarve(vye) vidyātatvaṃ tu vāmake |
madhyame śivatatvaṃ tu kalpayet kalpavittamaḥ || 
evaṃ yogāsanaṃ proktaṃ tasyordhve vimalāsanam | 
maṇḍalatritayaṃ(?) caiva kalpyaiva vimalāsanam ||
siṃhāsanaṃ catuṣkoṇamanantāsaṃ trikoṇakam | 
padmāsaṃ vartulākāraṃ ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vimalāsanam ||
yogāsanañcāṣṭakoṭam(ṇaṃ) āsanaṃ parikalpayet| 
āvāhanāsane yoge snāne siṃhāsanaṃ bhavet ||
arcanādhamahāpadmaṃ vimalākhyaṃ tu bhojanam | 
stotraṃ saṅgīta nṛttaṃ tu anantāsanameva ca || 
pūrvāhne sitavastraṃ tu madhyāhne raktavastrakam | 
sāyāhne pītavastraṃ tu sārdhayāme tu sarvaśaḥ || <f.20a>
bhaktyā niṣkalagoca(cā)raṃ samarasibhāgatā sādhakaḥ |
nādāntaṃ kramaśasya śaktikiraṇe nāde tathā binduke ||
niṣkrāntaṃ kramaśasya śaktikiraṇe syaddevamāvāhanam |
aṇḍāntasthaṃ yathā garbhaṃ liṅgāntasthaṃ śivaṃ tathā ||  
mātṛkukṣyāśrayo jīvapūrṇamātmasvarūpakam |
bhaktimantrakriyāyogāt sānnidhyaṃ niṣkalaśśivaḥ ||
prakṣālya pāṇipādau ca ācamya suvicakṣaṇaḥ |
sapavitrakareṇaiva sarvakāryaṃ samācaret ||
sthūlāgrañca napuṃsaketikasthitaṃ sthūlañca mūlaṃ hi vai |
nārī sāgra samūlamevakuthitaṃ puruṣeti saṃbhāṣitam ||
śyāmāge śravaṇāgrameva samakandīrghaṃ nakīḍāśritam  |
viśvāmitrakuśādaśīrakalamā dūrvā yavākāśavat ||
kuśāḥ kāśadaśīrāśca dūrvā ca vrīhibhistathā |
viśvāmitrayavāścaiva saptadarbhāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || <f.20b )
agrasthūlaṃ bhavennārī mūlasthūlaṃ napuṃsakam | 
mūlamagrasamevantu pumāndarbhasya lakṣaṇam ||
gopālaṃ kuśadarbhasyāt pavitraṃ kanakaprabham | 
trīṇipañcānalairvāpi pavitraṃ saṃyagācaret ||
tribhiḥ kuśaiśca darbhaiśca pavitraṃ śāntikaṃ bhavet |
pañcabhiḥ pauṣṭikaṃ proktaṃ caturbhiścābhicārakam ||
devakarmaṇidarbhaiśce pitṛkārye katobhavet |
agrantu caturaṅgulyaṃ granthirekāṅgulaṃ bhavet || 
dvayaṅgulaṃ tu valayaṃ pavitrasyatu lakṣaṇam |
agraṃ brahmādi daivatyaṃ granthiṃ viṣṇuṃ tathaiva ca ||
valayaṃ īśvaraṃ proktaṃ pavitrasyādhidevatāḥ |
yathāvajreṇa candrasyāt yathā śūlaṃ harasya ca ||
yathā viṣṇumathaścakraṃ brāhmaṇasya pavitrakam | <f.21a> 
hastayorubhayoścaiva nāmikāyāsuyojayet ||
sapavitra kareṇaiva kuryādācamanakriyām | 
nocchiṣṭaṃ tu pavitrasya bhuktocchiṣṭaṃ tu varjayet || 
tatvatithigṛhadhātu pañca aṣṭadaśāṅgulakūrca samānam | 
agrayugāṅgulagranthi tadardham uttamamadhyamakanyasakūrcam ||
ūrdhvāgraṃ puṣṭidaṃ proktaṃ adhograṃ śāntikaṃ bhavet | 
triṃśadviṣṭarasaṅgulīyakayugadarbhācchibāhvonnatam ||
ketodaṇḍaśiropaviṣṭamakulaṃ kūrcaṃ śratāsāgrakam |
kumbhasthaṃ kilapañcakastaraṇakaṃ saptaṃ hivāvai navam || 
jñānākhyāsidaśatrayañca ṣaḍukam evajjapet grāhikam | 
pavitralakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ parīdhī lakṣaṇaṃ śruṇu ||
sthūlañcāṅgulisannibhaṃ rajukaṃ śyāmañca cāropitam | 
kīḍo nāpi na daśataṃ śubhakaraṃ bāhūpamaṃ sāgrajam ||
evaṃ(?)kuḍaniveṣṭitañca paridhīn homārthamāklpitam | <f.21b>
saṃyak dvādaśamaṅgulañca samidhaṃ daṇḍagrahītākṛtim ||
paridhīlakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ bhasmasnānamataḥ param | 
kapilāyā gomayaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ śvetagomaya madhyamam ||
raktā kṛṣṇā'dhamaścaiva grāhayet padmapatrake | 
sadyena gomayaṃ grāhyaṃ piṇḍaṃ vāmena kārayet ||
aghorāstreṇa saṃśuṣkaṃ kuryādvai deśikottamaḥ | 
śivamantreṇa dagdhaṃ tu tatpuruṣeṇa tu grāhayet ||
alābupātre mantrīyān bhasmādhāretu vā kṣipet | 
mṛtkumbhetu nave sthāpya kavacenābhirakṣitam ||
pañcabrahma ṣaḍaṅgaiśca vyomavyāpiṃ japet sakṛt | 
dakṣiṇena kareṇaiva vāmahastetu nikṣipet || 
nirīkṣaṇādibhirkṛtvā pañcabrahmakalānyaset |
īśānena śiroddhūlya mukhaṃ tatpuruṣeṇa tu || 
aghoreṇaiva hṛdayaṃ bāhu jaṅghe ca nābhikam |
pṛṣṭhecorasi coddhūlya vāmadevena mantrataḥ || <f. 22a>  
madhyamānāmikā caiva tarjanyā ca stripuṇḍrakam |
brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca tripuṇḍrasyādhidevatāḥ || 
sṛṣṭisthitiśca saṃhāra tripuṇḍrasya trirekhayā |
pūrvāhne bhojane caiva ācane śayane'pi ca || 
bhasmasnānaṃ tripuṇḍrasyāt sarvarakṣā vidhīyate |
śrīkarañca pavitrañca śokaroganivāraṇam || 
lokavaśyakaraṃ puṇyaṃ bhasmaṃ trailokya sādhanam | 
śirasthāne svayaṃ brahma lalāṭe skandameva ca ||
karṇayorubhayoścaiva śrībhūmiścādhidevatāḥ | 
karṇe vināyaka prītiḥ bāhubhyāṃ keśavastathā ||
hṛdaye īśvaraṃ prīti nābhau caiva prajāpatiḥ | 
durgā sarasvatī caiva skande pṛṣṭe tathaiva ca ||
jāhnautu cāśvinau caiva pādayoḥ pannagastathā | 
sarvatīrtheṣu yatpuṇyaṃ sarvayajñeṣu yatphalam | <f. 22b>
koṭikoṭistu guṇitaṃ bhasmasnānena śuddhyati ||
caturvarṇasya sarveṣāṃ srīpuṃsaśca napuṃsakam | 
trikālaṃ vā dvikālaṃ vā ekakālāmathāpivā ||
sarvarakṣā ca matyānāṃ śivalokaṃ saka(ga)cchati | 
śivasya sannidhau kṛtvā devāgni gurusannidhau ||
bhasmoddhūlana kartavyaṃ kartavyaṃ śuddhi bhūtale | 
yāvattu patitā bhūmau bhasmasya parimāṇavaḥ ||
tāvadyuga sahasrāṇi tatkartā narakaṃ vrajet | 
pramādāt padi(ti)taṃ bhasma bhūmau hastena mārjya ca ||
mūrdhau rasāyusaṃspṛśya tataśśivamanusmaret |
ṣaḍaṅgulaṃ tu viprāṇāṃ kṣatryāṇāṃ caturaṅgulam || 
triyaṅgulaṃ tu vaiśyānāṃ tripuṇḍraṃ sarvakāmadam |
ekāṅgulaṃ tu śūdrāṇāṃ srīṇāṃ caiva tu tatsamam || 
tataḥ dyukteti matimān sarvapāpapraṇāśanam |
dusvapnadarśanañcaiva durjanasparśanepi ca | <f. 23a>
snānādaśaktaḥ puruṣo āturāṇāñca sarvadā |
bhasmasnānena śuddhyanti arcanāyogyamarhasi || 
jvararakṣa piśācāśca pāturāyātu dhānakāḥ |
kumāraguhabhūtāśca kūṣmāṇḍā ḍākinīrapi ||
vyāghrasarpabhayānāga sarverakṣāṃ vidhīyate |
liṅgākārañca bilvañca veṇupatraṃ tathaiva ca || 
aśvatthodumbaraṃ caiva śambhośśāsanalekhayā |
savibhagne ca bhukte ca vapane jalagāhane || 
ṣaṇḍamindrastriyāṃ spṛṣṭvā cāgneyaṃ snānamācaret | 
triṃśadaṇḍaṃ samārabhya vartulaṃ puṇḍrameva ca ||
tri(..)lañcārdhacandraṃ ca dīpaṃ pañcavidhaṃ kramāt | 
lalāṭanayanasyordhve daṇṇaṣaṃ paṭṭabandhake ||
vartulaṃ cordhvavaktraṃ tu tripuṇḍraṃ pūrvavaktrake | 
triśūlaṃ dakṣiṇevaktre ardhacandraṃ tu paścime ||
uttare vadane proktā dīpākāraṃ ṣaḍānanam | <f. 23b>
lalāṭanayanamadhyasthaṃ rakṣadhākti prayojanam || 
sarvadravyahutaṃ vahnirdoṣāyaḥ parikalpayet |
lalāṭe hṛdaye bāhvo caturaṅguladīrghikā || 
śvacchaśchekāṅgulā proktā evaṃ kṛtvā tripuṇḍrakam |
suptvā bhūtvā japitvā tu kṛtvā cāvaśyakādikam ||
pratīyadavasāneṣu bhasmasnānaṃ samācaret |
kākagradhṛvaraśvānyavarṇasaṃsparśanaṃ tathā || 
śavakūta smaśānauṣṭragrāmaṃ sūkarakukkuṭaiḥ | 
nirmālyabhojakapreta bhūtakā patitaissahā ||
tathānyaliṅgabhiścaivā vāruṇaṃ snānamācaret | 
jalasnānaśataḥ kṛtvā mantrasnānasahasraśaḥ ||
bhasmoddhūlanamātreṇa sarudraḥ prītidṛśyate | <f. 24a>
bhasmoddhūlana dehānāmāpāda tala mastakam ||
roma roma bhavelliṅgaṃ taddevaṃ śivamucyate | 
rakṣite sarvato dikṣu kṣīyate durviṣaṃ tathā ||
tasmārakṣeti saṃproktā śivahasta pradāyikā | 
bhūti bhūtikarī puṃsāṃ rakṣā rakṣakarī parām ||
bhasitaṃ bhāsitaṃ proktaṃ bhasmaṃ kalmaṣabhakṣaṇāt | 
bhasmāśraye yathā vahni tasminneva layaṃ gatā ||
bhasmasnānena tejasvī vahnivat dṛśyate nakhā (vā) | 
tripuṇḍraṃ brāhmaṇo vidvān manasāpi na laṅghayet ||
śṛtvā vidhīyate yasmāt tatyāgī patito bhavet | 
bhasitamasita karṇoddhūlanāhaṃ pavitraṃ 
bhavatu mamavidhūtyairmokṣalakṣī sukhātmam | <f. 24b>
etāni tāni śivamantra pavitratāni 
bhasmānikāma dahanāṅga vibhūṣitāni || 
traipuṇḍratāni rajatāni lalāṭapaṭṭe
lumbanti devalikhitāni durakṣarāṇi || 
arudrākṣadharo mantri yaḥ karoti śivārcanam | 
tattasya niṣphalaṃ proktaṃ bhasmenaiva hutāhaviḥ ||
rudrākṣadhārayedyastu sarudronyatra saṃśayaḥ |
rudrākṣa mṛṇmadhyāsya śvānopi trayate yadi || 
so'pi rudrasvamāpnoti kiṃ punarmānuṣādayaḥ |
rudrākṣāṣṭaśatena yena kalitā mālā satā(dā) dhāyya(rya)te | 
karṇe tena labhekṣaṇā kṣaṇamaho puṇyaṃ hayarjādikam ||
vidhyāgre mṛtakaḥ kharaśca yadabhuk rudrākṣabhārān vahan |
kailāse śatakoṭikalpa sadṛśaṃ hāhā navadyegaṇaḥ || 
śūdrahaste kṛte bhasme viprāṇāṃ natu dhārayet | 
dhārayedyati mohena sajale snānamācaret || <f. 25a>
bhasmasnānaṃ sunityaṃ śucikaramaniśaṃ vyādhināśaṃ sumokṣaṃ
gaṅgātīrthena tulyaṃ sakalaviṣaharaṃ krodhanāśaṃ suśāntam | 
yakṣaḥ paiśāca rakṣaḥ prabalamadaharaṃ tuṣṭipuṣṭissamṛddhiṃ 
vaśyaṃ loke narāṇāṃ sakalajana sukhaṃ pārvatīśa prasādam ||
bhasmasnānaṃ paraṃ tīrthaṃ nityaṃ pāpavināśanam | 
bhasmarūpaṃ śivaṃ sākṣāt bhasmaṃ tailokya sādhanam ||
rakṣārthaṃmaṅgalārthañca paramātmañca pāvanam | 
sitena bhasmanā kuryāt trisandhyā ca tripuṇḍrakam ||
sarvapāpa vimuktañca śivaloke mahīyate | 
bhasmasnānaṃ samākhyātaṃ māhendrasnānamācaret ||
vartamāne karāṃsau ca draṣṭau varṣati tiṣyati | 
prāṅmukhe nordhva bāhvo ca vāmasavyakarasthitā ||
mūlamantra japedvācā tāpadaiḥ padasaptakam | 
ādityādi mukhaṃ paścāt tannamastusya eva ca ||
evaṃ kṛteḥ mahāpāpaiḥ mucyate nātra saṃśayaḥ | <f.25b>
snānaṃ māhendramityuktaṃ mārutaṃ tyadhuna śṛṇu ||
pūrvāhne vā parāhne va rajasā gokṣatena tu | 
abhiṣiktastathomantri mūlamantramanusmaran ||
mantrasnānaṃ tadantetu prakṣālya pāṇipādayoḥ | 
hastaprakṣālyacācamya pātre kṣiptvā jalaṃ tathā ||
vyomavyāpipadaiścaiva ṣaḍaṅgaiḥ brahmapañcakaiḥ | 
mūlenaivatu tattoyaṃ abhimantrya sakṛt guruḥ ||
saṃspṛśet tena toyena mūlamantreṇa (..va)rmaṇā | 
mūrdhādi pādaparyantaṃ tridhā saṃspṛśanaṃ tathā ||
sarvapāpavinirmukta sarvaroga kṣayaṃ haret | 
vāruṇaṃ bhasmamāhendraṃ mārutaṃ mantrasaṃjñikam ||
evaṃ pañcavidhaṃ snānaṃ sarvakāryeṣu pūjitam | 
pañcasnānaṃ samākhyātaṃ pādyādīnāṃ vidhiṃ śṛṇu ||
kuṅkumañcandanaṃ dūrvā uśirasiddhārthakaṃ tathā | 
halenaiva samāyuktaṃ pādyamuttamamucyate || <f.26a>     
uśīraṃ candanaṃ caiva dūrvasiddhārthakaṃ tathā |
udakena samāyuktaṃ pādyamadhyamamucyate || 
candanośirasāyuktaṃ kanyasaṃ pādyamucyate |
pratyekaṃ dhāraṇaṃ śreṣṭaṃ tasyārdhaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet || 
tadardhamadhamaṃ jñeyaṃ pādyadravyamitismṛtam |
pādyaṃ dakṣiṇapādāni pratipādaṃ sakṛt sakṛt ||
pādyadravyamitikhyātaṃ dravyamācamanaṃ śṛṇu | 
uśīraṃ jātikarpūraṃ tuṭitrijñalavaṅgakam ||
udakenasamāyuktamuttamamācamanīyakam | 
elālavaṅga karpūramuśīraṃ jāti saṃyutam ||
jalenaiva samāyuktaṃ madhyamācamanasmṛtam | 
elālavaṅgabhasmāṅgaiḥ kanyasācamanaṃ smṛtam ||
eteṣāṃ tu pramāṇañca pūrvavat parikalpayet | 
mukheṣvācamanaṃ dadyāt avicchinnāmbu dhārayā ||
dravyamācamanaṃ proktam arghyadravyaṃ tataśṛṇu |
mustācanavanītañca kuśāgraṃ sitasarṣapam || <f.26b> 
karpūraṃ laghupatraṃ ca lavaṅgañcāṣṭamucyate |
arghyadravyamitikhyātaṃ pūjākāle śiro nyaset || 
āpakṣīrakuśāgrāṇi akṣatairyavataṇḍulaiḥ | 
tilaissiddharthakaṃ caiva arghyamuttamamucyate || 
yava(-)sarṣapa(-)śālyādi taṇḍulairmadhyamarghyakam |
udakaṃ taṇḍulaṃ śāli bhavedarghyaṃ tu kanyasam ||
arghyadravyapramāṇaṃ tu pūrvavatparikalpayet | 
arghyadravyaṃ samākhyātaṃ snānadravyaṃ tataśṛṇu ||
gaṅgādi sindhu saṃbhūtaṃ puṣkarāṇyāṃ tu saṃbhavam | 
suvāduvāsitaṃ puṣphaiḥ(ṣpaiḥ) navamṛtkumbha pūritam ||
śuddhavastrasutaṃ śuddhamelādyamoda saṃyutam |
elośīra phalatryāmalasitaiḥ karpūrasatkuṅkumaiḥ 
śrīgandhāgarupatrakaiśca kusumairāmodabhissaṃyutāḥ |
āpo mārjana karmaṇi praṇihitāḥ śambhoryathā lābhataḥ 
proktadravya guṇeṣu labdhamihayat grāhyamadhye'taraiḥ || <f.27a>
candanaṃ tuṭikarpūraṃ tatkolo'śira jāyate |
udake niṣkamāropya jaleṣvāropya yatnataḥ ||
apidhāya vidhānena svarṇagupte nidhāpayet |
jaladroṇasamādāya vastrapūtena vāriṇā || 
aṣṭadroṇairathātbhistu snānaṃ kanyasamucyate | 
dviguṇaṃ madhyamaṃ jñeyam uttamaṃ triguṇaṃ bhavet || 
bhārādi navabhārāntaṃ navaliṅgedhamādhame |
ekabhārapi vraddhyātu yatproktaṃ(?)navasaṃkhyayā || 
śivāmbhasa(sā) itijñeyā śivamantreṇa mantritaḥ |
cāturjātaṃ ca takkolam uśīraṃ jātipuṣpakam || 
ityete saptadravyāṇi pañcadravyamitismṛtam | 
snānadravyamitikhyātaṃ vastralakṣaṇamucyate || 
vasāṃsi suvicitrāṇi sāravanti mṛdūni ca |
(tamukkālaṃ caiva kaccolam uśiraṃ campakaṃ tathā |
hariberañca sarveṣāṃ pañcadravyamiti smṛtam || )
yūpitāni supuṣpāṇi vikeśāni navāni ca| <f.27b>
sauvarṇa mūrṇa sūtreṇa kārpāsokta dukūlakam || 
devālaṅkāra yogyena pramāṇena samanvitam |
devāṅgamuttamaṃ proktaṃ madhyamaṃ kṣomamucyate || 
kārpāsa tantujaṃ vastram adhamaṃ parikalpitam |
uttamaṃ ṣaḍaśaṃ hastaṃ madhyamaṃ dvādaśaṃ bhavet || 
adhamaṃ navahastaṃ syāt trividhaṃ parikalpayet |
uttamaṃ navahastaṃ syātmadhyamaṃ saptahastakam || 
adhamaṃ pañcahastaṃ syāt vastralakṣaṇamucyate |
yāvattatvastra tantūnāṃ parimāṇaṃ vidhīyate || 
tāvadyuga sahasrāṇa(ṇi) śivaloke mahīyate | 
asitaṃ sthānanāśaṃ syāt hataṃ rājñaśca doṣakṛt || 
darśanaṃ grāmanāśaṃ syāt rāṣṭranāśamalakṣaṇam | <f.27a 2>
vastralakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ gandhalakṣaṇamucyate ||
karpūraṃ kuṅkumaṃ patraṃ khaṭgaṃcaiva phalatrayam | 
candanośira lohaiśca gandhamuttamamucyate ||
uśirañcandanañcai(va) karpūrañcaphalatrayam |
ghana khaṭgaṃ samāyuktaṃ madhyamaṃ gandhamucyate || 
himaṃ ghanañca karpūraṃ kanyasaṃ gandhamucyate |
divyaṃ pratiphalaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ tasyārdhaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet || 
tadardhamadhamaṃ jñeyaṃ gandhamevaṃ prakīrtidam |
gandhadravyamitikhyātaṃ śaṅkha lakṣaṇamucyate || 
saṃvarṇaṃ rajataṃ tāmraṃ kāṃsyapātraṃ viśeṣataḥ |
palāśapadmapatrābhyāṃ tāmrapātraṃ samaṃ bhavet ||
śaṅkhaṃ caturvidhaṃ jñeyaṃ brāhmaṇādi krameṇatu | 
laghucā evasaubhāvaṃ dīrghāgraṃ pṛṣṭatassamam ||
udaraṃ pūrṇa itvātu brāhmaṇaśśaṅkhamucyate | <f.27b 2>
agredīrghaṃ samaṃ pucchaṃ lāvaṇyāṃ kanakojvalam ||
dakṣiṇāvarta vṛttena kṣatriyaṃ śaṅkhamucyate |
īṣat pītasya varṇena vāmavṛttena saṃyutam || <f.28a>
gurulaghu samañcaiva vaiśyaśaṅkhamitismṛtam | 
śūdrajātaṃ laghuñcaiva dīrghāgraṃ hrasvapṛṣṭakam || 
īṣat kṛṣṇaṃ samāśṛtya śūdraśaṅkhamitismṛtam |
gaṅgāsāgaramadhyetu brāhmaṇakṣatra śaṅkhayoḥ ||(?) 
ni(na)rmadāsindhu madhyetu vaiśyaśūdrasya śakṅkhayoḥ |
sarve pūrṇakarīṃ dadyāt dakṣiṇāvṛttamucyate || 
agre viṣṇumayaṃ proktaṃ kukṣirgaṅgāsarasvatī | 
pṛṣṭe prajāpatikhyātaṃ pārśvecāśvini devatāḥ ||
 devaśca(cha)ndṛṣiścaiva candrasāvitricāṅgiraḥ | 
ācārye dhārayeśśaṅkhaṃ śaktimantramanusmaran ||
śaṅkhalakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ pañcagavyaṃ tataḥ śṛṇu | 
nava kṛtamadhye dugdhamaindre dadhisyāt 
yamadiśi ghṛtamindorvāruṇe gomaye dve | 
anala niṛti vāyuriṃśakoṇeṣu piṣṭhā
malakarajanitoyaḥ sthāpayet pañcagavyam || <f.28b>
savye sādākhyavidye vihita navapade puṃso prakṛtvā
tatvākhye koṣṭa ṣaṭke tadanu viracayat supratiṣṭaṃ suśāntam 
tejo rūpañca ratno'dakamamṛtam avyaktapātreṣu teṣu 
kṣīraṃ dadhyājya gomūtra gomayakuśajalam ||
gairikā vāca pādyaṃ śivaṃ sadāśivaṃ puṃstatvaṃ kālasaṃjñakam | 
niyatiṃ ca kalārāgaṃ vidyākoṣṭannapīṃ budhaḥ ||
supratiṣṭaṃ suśāntā ca tejovat ratnajaṃ hṛdā | 
amṛtā vyaktapātrāṇi iti pātrāṇi yojayet || 
prāgagraṃ tu catussūtram udaksūtraṃ tathaiva ca |
tālamātra pramāṇena kārayeddeśikottamaḥ || 
śālane māḍhakaṃ proktaṃ triprasthaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet |
dviprasthamadhamaṃ jñeyaṃ kalaśānāṃ pṛthak pṛthak || 
tadardhaistaṇḍulairbhūṣya tadardhaiśca tilairapi |
lājadarbhaiśca puṣpaiśca vikareśca viśeṣataḥ || <f. 29a>  
kalaśān lakṣaṇopetān catuprasthena pūritān | 
sūtreṇa veṣṭayet sarvān gavākṣasadṛśāntarān ||
taṇḍulaṃ brahmadaivatyaṃ darbhāṇaṃ (ṇāṃ) viṣṇu daivatam | 
sūtramīśvaradaivatyam adhidevāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||
kapilāyā ghṛtaṃ śreṣṭaṃ kṛṣṇāyāṃ kṣīramuttamam | 
śvetāyaṃ(yāṃ) dadhimukhyaṃ syāt raktagomūtrameva ca ||
jhaṣapātranibhañcaiva sakṛduktanipedakam | 
evaṃ vai gavya lābhaṃ tu śvetā'tha kṛṣṇa eva ca ||
darśakāla prasannātmā savatsāṅgaṃ vidhīyate | 
gṛhītvā gomayaṃ hastaṃ bhūmau naḥ patitaṃ śubham ||
āharetu prayatnena sadyodugdhaṃ tu yat padaḥ | 
anāmya dadhigṛhṇīyāt sudṛḍhaṃ prayadarśanam ||
kāśyapaṃ ghṛtamevaṃ tu kauśikaṃ dadhirucyate |
kṣīraṃ tu bhāradvājaṃ syāt gautamaṃ gomayaṃ tathā ||
agastyaścaiva gomūtraṃ ṛṣayaḥ parikīrtitāḥ | <f. 29b>
ghṛtaṃ(?) vai rudra daivatyaṃ dadhiṃ vai somadaivatam ||
kṣīraṃ tu śukradaivatyaṃ gomayaṃ cārkadaivatam | 
gaṅgāyāñcaiva gomūtraṃ pañcagavyādhidevatāḥ ||
uttamaṃ droṇamevaṃ tu madhyamaṃ tu tadardhakam | 
tadardhamadhamaṃ jñeyaṃ trividhaṃ parikalpayet ||
ghṛtaṃ vai prasthameva dadhi dviprasthameva ca | 
triprasthaṃ kṣīramevoktaṃ catuprasthaṃ tu gomayam ||
ṣaṭ prasthaṃ caiva gomūtraṃ uttamaṃ tu praśasyate | 
īśānādīni sadyāntaṃ pūjayettu viśeṣataḥ ||
ekadvitricatuḥpañca vāraiṣaṭbhikṣu śobhitam | 
dugdhaṃ śatṛnivāraṇaṃ dadhighṛtaṃ putrapradaṃ mokṣadam
pāpaghnaṃkhila gomayaṃ śubhakaraṃ gomūtradhārājalam | 
etatsarvakaraṃ kuśāgrasalilaṃ gandhena sāmiśradaṃ
kṣudvāyuṣya'bhirāmadaṃ yajunṛṇāṃ snānādi puṇyatrayam || <f. 30a>
payaśca śatṛnāśaṃ syāt dadhiputro vivardhanam | 
ghṛtaṃ mokṣapradaṃ caiva gomūtraṃ śrīkaraṃ bhavet ||
gomayaṃ pāpanāśaṃ syāt pañcagavyaphalaṃ bhavet | 
gomūtraṃ gomayaṃ kṣīraṃ dadhi sarpi kuśodakam ||
brahmakūrcamitikhyātaṃ pūjākālebhiṣecayet | 
pañcagavya samākhyātaṃ pañcamṛtaṃ tataśṛṇu ||
mantri randhrapadaṃ vidhāya vidhivat dugdhaṃ vidhau pūjayet
devendre dadhibhānu jenavabhṛtaṃ somemayuprokthitam | 
paścāt śodhita śarkarāñca varuṇaṃ vahnau ca dhātrīṃ tathā 
rātriṃ rātri caretu piṣṭamanilaṃ śambhoḥ kuśāmbhustathā || 
kṣīraṃ dadhi ghṛtaṃ caiva śarkarāmadhupañcakam |
kṣaudraṃ dugdhaṃ sitaṃ sarpi ikṣusāraṃ pṛthak pṛthak || <f. 30b>
payodadhi ghṛtaṃ kṣaudraṃ śarkarādyairanukramāt | 
phalasāre'kṣu sārañca puṣpasāraṃ tathaiva ca || 
nālikera ghṛtaṃ caiva pañcamṛtamihocyate | 
pañcāmṛtamidaṃ brahma pūjayetsūktamantrataḥ ||
pañcāmṛtamidaṃ proktaṃ brahmāṅgāni prapūjayet |
pratyekaṃ prasthasaṃpūrṇaṃ madhyamaṃ tu tadardhakam || 
tadardhamadhamaṃ jñeyaṃ pañcāmṛtamihocyate |
pañcametāni pañcaite abhiṣekaṃ pṛthak pṛthak || 
abhiṣekaṃ prakartavyaṃ sadyādi brahmapañcakaiḥ | 
kalpakoṭi sahasrāṇi śivaloke mahīyate ||
snāpayeddevadeveśaṃ dadhi kṣīraṃ ghṛtaistathā | 
nālikero ghṛtenaiva madhunāṃ brahmapañcakaiḥ ||
pañcāmṛtamidaṃ proktam upacārānathaśṛṇu | 
pādya pādau ta(da)deddhīmān pratipādaṃ sakṛt sakṛt ||
mukheśvācamanaṃ dadyāt avicchinnāmbu dhārayā | <f. 31a>
arghyaṃ śirasi vinyasya gandhamaṅgānulepanam ||
puṣpaṃ mūrdhniṣu vinyasya dhūpaṃ nāsāpuṭā prabhau | 
dīpaṃ netreṣu vinyasya bhakṣyaṃ karatale nyaset ||
bhakṣyaṃ bhojyannapānādi coṣyaṃ lehyaṃ tathaiva ca | 
haste dvaktana puṣpañca paścādācamanaṃ dadet ||
pādyaṃ pṛthivi daivatyam ācamanīyaṃ sarasvatī | 
arghyaṃ śrīdevi daivatyaṃ gandhaṃ vai vāyudaivatam || 
puṣpaṃ gandharva daivatyaṃ dhūpaṃ vai candra daivatam |
dīpaṃ caivārka daivatyaṃ sarveṣāṃ bhāvayet budhaḥ || 
 sarveṣāṃ devatānāñca savyahastena dhārayet |
pādyaṃ tu pāpanāśaṃ syāt ācamanīyaṃ śriyāvaham || 
arghyaṃ tu karma sāphalyaṃ gandhaṃ govardhanaṃ bhavet |
puṣpaṃ puṣṭikaraṃ proktaṃ dhūpadānaṃ tu śuddhidam || 
dīpaṃ vaśyakaraṃ proktam ārātrikaṃ jayapradam | 
bhasmaṃ viśvasya rakṣārthaṃ bhūpateśca viśeṣataḥ ||
darpaṇaṃ jñānadaṃ proktaṃ chatramājña (jñā)prapālanam | <f. 31b>
cāmaraṃ śatṛnāśaṃ syāt gītaṃ vādya (m) sukhapradam ||
naidedyaṃ dhānya vṛddhiṃ syāt pānīyaṃ prāṇarakṣakam | 
kṣīrādi madhuraiścānyaiḥ sṛṣṭyarthaṃ grahaśāntikam || 
tāmbūlaṃ puṣpadānaṃ ca lokānāṃ saukhyamāpnuyāt | 
snānaṃ ca roganāśārthaṃ pañcagavyaṃ malāpaham ||
ātmasṛṣṭikaraṃ proktaṃ vastradānaṃ bhavedihā | 
bhogāṅga pūjanañcaiva sarvabhogamavāpnuyāt || 
hemaratnapravālādi bhūṣaṇairardhasaṃbhavam | 
phalaṃ sarva samṛddhiṃ syāt sarva duṣkṛtaśāntikam ||
triśūlādyāyudhānāñca sarvamantrābhayaṃ bhavet | 
roga śokādi nāśam syāt sarvadāridranāśanam ||
sarva śatṛkṣayakaraṃ sarvopadrava nāśanam | 
sarva śāntikaraṃ nṛṇāṃ devānāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ ||
āvāhanādikaṃ tasya dvādaśaṃ mātramucyate | 
pādyaṃ tu pañcamātraṃ syāt āmā āmācanaṃ tathā ||
ekamātraṃ bhavedarghyaṃ ṣaṇmātraṃ gandhalepanam | 
dhūpaṃ dvādaśamātraṃ syāt ṣaṇmātrī dīpamucyate ||
ārātryamarcanaṃ sapta nīrāñjanaṃ tu ṣoḍaśa | <f. 32a>
bhasmānāṃ dāpayet paścāt saptamātraṃ tu kathyate ||
vyajanaṃ ca trimātraṃ syāt cāmaraṃ daśamātrakam | 
chatraṃ tu pañcamātraṃ syāt munimātraṃ ca darpaṇam ||
nivedanaṃ tataḥ kuryāt caturviṃśati mātrakam | 
balipradānakālaṃ yat adhikaṃ pañcaviṃśati ||
saukhyaṃ tu triṃśataṃ proktaṃ nāḍikāyāṃ tu saṅkhyayā | 
pūjya pūjakabhāvena jñātvā yajanamārabhet || 
pūjya eva śivañcaiva pūjyakaśśaktirucyate | 
pūjāhīne bhavedrogo puṣpahīne dhanakṣayam || 
dhūpahīne sukhaṃ nāśaṃ dīpahīne kulakṣayam |
gandhahīne bhavet kuṣṭaṃ toyahīne tu duḥkhitam || 
naivedya hīne durbhikṣaṃ mantrahīne daridrakam | 
vastrahīne mahā rogaṃ homahīne balakṣayam || 
balihīne grāmanāśaṃ syāt ājyahīne tu māraṇam |
bilvadūrvākṣatāhīne śatṛbhyo bhayamāpnuyāt || <f. 32b>
ghaṇṭāhīne tu badhirāt mudrāhīne surābhayam |
nityāgnikāryahīne tu pūjāyāṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet || 
snapanaṃ nityotsavaṃ hīne rājarāṣṭrabhayaṃ bhavet |
sasyadravyavihīne ca devatā kopameva ca || 
dravyahīnaṃ tataḥ kartuṃ mantrahīnaṃ tathā gurum |
pūjahīne tu vaikalyaṃ putrastrībhūmināśanam || 
pādyādīnāṃ vihīne tu rākṣasaiḥ paribhūyate |
tasmāt sarva prayatnena devatā bhakti pūrvakam || 
 maddalañca sukhañcaiva tālakyeśa haraṃ bhavet |
paṭahaṃ pāpahārī ca bherīñca puṣṭivardhanam ||
vāmahasthe(ste)prayañcekaṃ samatāle śriyāvaham |
jhallarī iṣṭakāmyasyāt kumbhavādyaṃ ca mokṣadam ||
nāḍīsandhāna vādyaṃ ca koṭiyajñaphalaṃ bhavet | 
vaiṇavaṃ suśiraṃ gānaṃ putrapautravivardhanam ||
cāru carmaṇi sandhānaṃ vādyaghoṣaṃ jayāvaham | <f. 33a>
lśaṅkhadhvani samāyuktaṃ sarvaśatṛvināśanam ||
nṛttaṃ vyādhi vināśaṃ ca gītamāyuṣyavardhanam | 
nāṭkaṃ dhānyavṛddhiṃ syāt śuddhanṛtte śubhaṃ tathā ||
ahamāgeṇa kauṇḍalye rājāvijayamāpnuyāt | 
nyālaṃ trailokyavaśyaṃ ca kiṭukaṃ ca sukhāvaham ||
kāhalaṃ doṣaśuddhyarthaṃ murasā vṛṣṭi saṃbhavam | 
saramaṇḍala vīṇāñca śauryaṃ ca dhairyasaṃyutam ||
timilaṃ vijayaṃ proktaṃ pā(/)vākatālaṃ vittasaṃbhavam | 
dhārayassarvasiddhiṃ syāt cihnaṃ rājavaśīkaram ||
trayakṣa bhogamokṣañca katrakā strīvaśyakaram | 
garbhagehaṃ samāviśya śivadvija samācaret ||
adhyainamātra viprāṇām ardhamaṇṭapa saṃsthitam | 
dīkṣitānāṃ tapasvīnāṃ bāhyamaṇṭapa saṃsthitāḥ ||
rājarājakulastrīṇāṃ nṛttamaṇṭapa saṃsthitam | 
adīkṣitānāṃ parastrīṇāṃ gopuradvārasaṃsthitam || <f.33b>
anyajātiṣu sarveṣu sphūpi dṛṣvā samācaret |
ālayapraveśamākhyātaṃ puṣpāṇāñca vidhiṃ śṛṇu || 
pūrvadvārasya pālautu nandīkāla pratiṣṭi(ṣṭhi)tam |
dakṣiṇadvārapālau ca daṇḍīmuṇḍī pratiṣṭi(ṣṭhi)tallm || 
paścimadvārapālau ca bṛṅgīśo vijayakramāt |
uttaradvārapālau tu anantaṃ pāśupatistathā ||
nandīnāṃ śyāmavarṇaṃ tu dakṣiṇe tu pratiṣṭhitam | 
mahākālau kuṅkumābhau uttare tu pratiṣṭhitam ||
daṇḍīcaipendrakovābhau dakṣiṇe tasya vasthitaḥ | 
muṇḍī tu śvetarūpaṃ syādvāmabhāge tu vinyaset || 
bhṛṅgī mayūragrīvābhau dakṣiṇe sthāpayet kramāt | 
vāme tu vijayaṃ sthāpya vidrumābhaśca saṃyutam || 
anantaṃ ghanarūpaṃ syāt savyabhāge tu vinyaset | 
asavye sthāpite dhīmān paśupatī nīlavarṇakam || 
nandīśo daṇḍahastaṃ syāt kālau paraśu dhārakam |
daṇḍīśo khaḍgahastaṃ syāt muṇḍīśaḥ piṇḍipālayuk || <f. 34a>
bhṛṅgī tu śaktihastaṃ syāt vijayo śūladhārakaḥ |
ananto vajrahastaṃ syāt paśupatiḥ phā(pā)śameva ca || 
triṇetrāścaturbhujāssarve dvibhujāva(vā)pi kārayet | 
sarvābharaṇa saṃyuktau makuṭādyairvibhūṣitau ||
kaṭisūtraṃ tu ścapūraiśca ścannavīraiśca sauyutau | 
etaiḥ lakṣaṇa saṃyuktaṃ dvāre dvāre pratiṣṭhitam ||
antarmaṇḍalake dvāre nandīkālau pratiṣṭhitau | 
bhuvaṅgañca pataṅgañca jalikādyadhidevatāḥ ||
vimalāśca subāhuñca pūjayettu kavāṭayoḥ | 
paṭṭikāskandamabhyarcya valayaṃ sūryasomayoḥ ||
suṣire navaśaktiśca astreṇamādharaṃ vrajet | 
gaṇeśabhāratī lakṣmī nandīgaṅgāstathaiva ca ||
mahākālaṃ ca yamune astrān vāstu prakīrtitāḥ | 
vṛṣabhaṃ pūjayedagre gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ kramāt || <f. 34b>
antarhāre tu kartavyau bhṛṅgīśau vijaya kramāt |
madhyādi bhaktike kuryāt ananto paśupatistathā || 
mahāgopura saṃyuktau kumbhodaramahodaraḥ | 
bhūtopakārayedantau daṇḍahastau mahābalau || 
dvārapūjāvidhiṃ hyevaṃ parivārārcanaṃ śṛṇu |
vṛṣabhaṃ śveta varṇaṃ tīṣṇa(kṣṇa)śṛṅgamahābalam || 
catuṣpādaṃ vedarūpam agnirūpaṃ tu śṛṅgakam |
ādityaścaiva gopālaṃ mukhaṃ rudraṃ tathaiva ca ||
brahmā viṣṇuśca rudraśca sarvadevamayaṃ vṛṣam |
prapañca sṛṣṭikāle tu pañcavarṇena gotbhavam || 
saptasāgaramadhyaṃ tu bhūloketu praveśakam |
catuṣpādaṃ(?) caturvedaṃ dharmarūpaṃ tathābhavet || 
romāgre bhīṣaṇā proktaḥ karṇayodvāca vāsukī |
nāsikāyāṃ mahendraṃ ca candrādityau tu cakṣuṣaḥ ||
dante rudramitijñeyaṃ jihvā madhye tu vaiṣṇavam | <f. 35a>
adharaṃ brahmadaivatyaṃ skandordakṣiṇa śṛṅgakam ||
vighneśo vāmaśṛṅge tu lalāṭe tu sadāśivam | 
śṛṅgamadhye śivaṃ proktaṃ pucchāgre sarvatīrthakam ||
ityevaṃ(?) yajane kāle bhāvayettu vicakṣaṇaḥ |
raktāmbaradharaṃ bhīmaṃ ūrdhvakeśaṃ śikhānvitam || 
śakti tomara saṃyuktaṃ jvālāmālā vibhūṣitam |
agniṃ kuryādajārūḍhaṃ saptajihvābhirāvṛtam || 
gokṣīra dhavalaprakhyaṃ dvibhujaṃ(?)ca dvinetrakam |
raśmimaṇḍala saṃyuktaṃ vaiḍūryamakuṭānvitam || 
rohiṇī sahitaṃ(?)candraṃ kuryāt kumudahastakam | 
mātṛṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ vakṣye varṇa(-)vāhana(-)cihnakaiḥ ||
padmāsanasthāṃ bhadraṃ śīṃ kuryāllakṣṇamucyate | 
caturbhuja viśālākṣau taptakāñcana sannibhau ||
varadābhayahastaṃ ca kamaṇḍalvakṣamālikā | <f. 35b>
haṃśadhvajā haṃsarūḍhā jaṭāmakuṭadhāriṇīm ||
raktapadma(dmā)sanāsīnāṃ brahmāṇī brahmarūpiṇīm | 
śaṅkhakundendu varṇābhāṃ kṛṣṇā paraśusaṃyutā || 
trilocanaśśuklavarṇābhā śūlapāṇi vṛṣadhvajā |
varadābhaya hastā ca akṣamālā karānvitām ||
jaṭāmakuṭa nī śambho bhūṣaṇī ca maheśvarīm | 
kukkuṭadhvaja saṃyuktaṃ kuṅkumastana bhūṣitā ||
śakti tomara saṃyuktā varadābhaya hastakā | 
draḍhamārūḍha saṃyuktam audumbarikalāśritā ||
kṣaumavastra dharaṃ devīṃ kārayettu grahagrajām | 
śaṅkhacakradharaṃ(?) devīṃ varadābhaya hastakām ||
kirīṭamakuṭairyuktāṃ(?)hārakaiyūrabhūṣitām | 
sustanāṃ cāru vadanāṃ śyāmavarṇāṃ suyauvanām ||
rājavṛkṣaśritāṃ devīṃ garuḍadhvaja saṃyutām | <f. 36a> 
vaiṣṇavīṃ kārayeddevīṃ vārāhīñca tataḥ śṛṇu ||
nīlavarṇamahārūpāṃ karaṇḍamakuṭojvalām | 
kṛṣṇāmbaradharaṃ(rāṃ) daṃṣṭrāṃ vārāhisthādṛśānanam ||
caturbhujāṃ cāruvaktrāṃ vaṭavṛkṣasamāśritām | 
caturvaktradharāṃ devīṃ varadābhayapāṇinīm ||
hemaśṛṅgārayeddhīmān candanadrumasaṃyutām | 
varadābhayahastāñca karañca drumasaṃyutām ||
sihmadhvajasamāyuktāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām | 
gajadhvajasammayuktāṃ chatracāmara saṃyutām ||
raktamaṇḍala varṇāñca kirīṭamakuṭojvalām |
vajrapāśa samāyuktāṃ kalpadrumasamāyutām || 
indrāṇīṃ kārayeddevīṃ divyapuṣpobhiśobhitām |
cāmuṇḍīṃ kārayeddhīmān kālamegha samaprabhām || <f. 36b>
śūlaṃ kapālasaṃyuktāṃ śyāmavarṇāṃ caturbhujām |
ūrdhvakeśīṃ śaṅkhabhīṃśca gobhitāṃ gāvakuṇḍitām || 
 pretadhvajasamāyuktāṃ vaṭavṛkṣasamāśṛtām |
śyāmābhāṃ raktavarṇāṃ jvalana ganibhujām aṣṭadivyā karābhyāṃ 
śūlaṃ vetāla khaṭgaṃ ḍamaruka sahitaṃ vāmahaste kapālam | 
anyaṃ ghaṇṭodhva kheṭāṃ haladhara sahitaṃ raudrabhāvaṃ triṇetraṃ
cāmuṇḍā rūpametat bhuvana vaśikarīṃ bhadrakālīṃ namaste || 
vighneśaṃ pūrvavat kuryāt sarvalakṣaṇ saṃyutam | 
kuṅkumavarṇa caturbhujayuktaṃ nāgamukhaṃ makuṭaṃ saguraṇḍam ||
aṅkuśalaḍḍukadantasupāśaṃ vahnyadṛśaṃ gaṇanāthasvarūpam | 
taruṇāditya saṅkāśaṃ śaśvat bālāsvarūpiṇīm ||
caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ | <f.37a>
hārakeyūra saṃyuktaṃ mayūravāhanaṃ tathā ||
savye tvābhayavajrau tu varadāṅkuśa vāmake | 
vidrumānibhaṃ dvidaśahasta rasavaktraṃ 
śaktiśarakhaḍgamabhayadhvajagadā ca |
vāmakaracāpakuliśañcikaṭakaṃ syāt
śūladhara paṅkajasu ṣaṇmukhasvarūpam ||
sindhūrāruṇamindukānti vadanaṃ keyūrahārādibhiḥ
divyairābharaṇairvibhūṣitatanusvargasya saukhyapradam | 
ambhojābhaya śakti kukkuṭadharaṃ raktāṅgarāgāśukaṃ
subrahmaṇyamupāsmahe praṇamatobhītipraṇā śodyatām || 
kulṅkumavarṇaṃ caturbhujayuktaṃ śaktidharābhaya dakṣiṇa hastam |
vajradharāvayaduttarahastaṃ skandakumāramidaṃ kamalastam ||
kumāralakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ lakṣmīrūpaṃ tataśṛṇu | 
tanmadhyataḥ kamalamabjasukhopaviṣṭāṃ
astidvayodhṛta ghaṭāmbu kṛtābhiṣekām | <f. 37b>
savye varābja sahitāmahatīñca lakṣmīṃ
vāmeṣu bilvaphalapadmadharāṃ supītām || 
lakṣmī lakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ jyeṣṭhā lakṣaṇamucyate |
kanyāputrasamāyuktāṃ kākadhvaja samanvitām || 
raktavastradharāṃ devīṃ muktābharaṇabhūṣitām |
sarvābharaṇa saṃyuktāṃ kalaṃ pagnīṃ tu kārayet ||
jyeṣṭhālakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ durgā lakṣaṇamucyate |
savastraṃ nīlakeśaṃ ca nīlotpaladalākṛtim || 
sustanañcāruvadanāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām |
cakrañcābhayahastaṃ ca varadāñca caturbhujām ||
kuśabandhana saṃyuktāṃ māhiṣasya śa(śi)rasthitām |
hastayugmaka raktapaṅkajamudvahaṃ datisundaraṃ
siddhavidruma hemakañcukamambarañca śubhadvitīm |
ratnakuṇḍala hārakeyūrakarṇapuṣpakaraṇḍadhṛt 
nityabodhamayaṃ divākara viśvakarma karaprabhum ||
divyarūpaṃ jagatrāntaṃ padmakañcuka sannibham | <f. 38a>
prabhāmaṇḍala saṃyuktaṃ kambugrīvaṃ sulocanam ||
uṣapratyuṣa saṃyuktaṃ karaṇḍamakuṭānvitam | 
karasyobhaudhṛtaṃ padmaṃ dhārayantaṃ mahā prabhum ||
sarvalakṣaṇa saṃyuktaṃ kuryādādityamūrtinam | 
ādityalakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ kṣetrapālavidhiṃ śṛṇu ||
kṣetrasau(syai)śānadigbhāge pūjanīya yathāvidhiḥ | 
śūlaṃ kapāla ṭaṅkaṃ ca pāśañcaivāyudhasmṛtām || 
trividhaṃ tu samākhyātaṃ guṇatrayavibhāgaśaḥ |
sātvikaṃ śvetarūpaṃ tu rājasaṃ raktavarṇakam || 
tāmasaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ tu trividhaṃ sumudāhṛtam |
tamasāṣṭabhujā proktā rājasaṃ ṣaṭ bhujo bhavet || 
caturbhujo viśeṣeṇā sātvikañca yathā vidhiḥ |
śūlaṃ kapāla ṭaṅkaṃ ca pāśañcaivāyudhasmṛtām || 
ūrdhvakeśaṃ suvṛttākṣaṃ kuñcitabhūsvaryavān |
sakuñcitāgra kāyastu nāgābharaṇabhūṣitam || 
nagnarūpa triṇetraṃ tu pādanūpura saṃyutam |
śunoparisthita śrīmān aṣṭabhirdorbhirañcitam || <f. 38b>
śūlaṃ pāśaṃ tathā khaṭgaṃ khaṭvāṅgaṃ dakṣiṇe kare |
kapālaṃ paraśuṃ caiva kheṭaghaṇṭāñca vāmake || 
vetālairbhūtabṛndaiśca śvabhiḥ parivṛto bhavet |
ebhistu lakṣaṇairyuktaṃ kṣetrapālamitismṛtam || 
nirvāṇaṃ nirvikalpaṃ nirupamavibhuṃ nirvikārakṣakāraṃ
huṃkāraṃ vaktradaṃṣṭraṃ hutavahanayanaṃ raudramunmattabhāvam |
phaṭ kāraṃ bandhanāgaṃ bhrakuṭitaṭamukhaṃ bhairavaṃ śūlapāṇiṃ 
khaṭvāṅgaṃ nṛkkapālaṃ ḍamaruka sahitaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ namāmi || 
raktajvālajaṭādharaṃ śaśidharaṃ raktāṅgatejomayaṃ 
haste daṇḍakapālapātradhāriṇaṃ lokasya rakṣākaram | 
nirvāṇaṃ śunavāhanaṃ trinayanam ānandakolāhalaṃ
vande bhūta piśāca nātha vaṭukaṃ kṣetrasyapālaṃ śivam || 
tataḥ purastito pīṭhe pūjanīyā viśeṣataḥ |
śiraḥ pañca samavaktra samanāsi nayanaṃ 
daśakarṇa daśabāhu daśaśūla daśadhṛk | <f.39a>  
galamekahṛdayepi atiraktavarṇaṃ 
dvayapādamitibhūta balipīṭha balibhuk || 
āmodaśca pramodaśca pramukho durmukhastathā |
avighno vighnakartāro balipīṭhādhidevatāḥ || 
pūrvetu dakṣiṇe caiva paścimottarameva ca |
madhyetu padmamālikhya īśānenatu pūjayet || 
āmodaṃ śyāmavarṇasthāḥ pramodaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇakam |
pramukhaṃ sphaṭikābhāso dvimukhaḥ kuṅkumaprabhāḥ || 
avighno vidrumābhāsaṃ vighnakartāranāmrabhāk |
yakṣarākṣasapaiśāca bhūtagandharvi(rva)kinnarām ||
pitradānava nāgaścā brahmādyaiśānamontakam |
praṇavādi caturthyantaṃ svanāmapada madhyamam || 
svāhāntaṃ balinirdeśaṃ sarvebhya iti yojayet |
iṣṭikā pīṭha mṛtpīṭhaṃ pīṭhādābhāsamucyate || 
ābhāsāt bhitticitrañca dāravān mṛṇmayaṃ bhavet |
dāravān mṛṇmayaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ mṛṇmayā lohajaṃ tathā || <f. 39b>
lohajāt śailajaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ śailajāt ratnajaṃ tathā | 
calatvā loha ratnaiśca mūlaberaṃ tu kārayet ||
dravyotkṛṣṭena kartavyaṃ viparītaṃ na kārayet | 
sadyena padmamūlaṃ tu vāmadevaṃ sanālakam ||
aghoraṃ dalasaṅkīrṇaṃ puruṣaṃ guhyakesaram |
īśānaṃ karṇikāgrāntaṃ padmaṃ śivamayaṃ tathā || 
śaktiyoni(sti)sthitaṃ padmaṃ madhyetu jvalaliṅgakam | 
padmanālaṃ śivāliṅgaṃ sarvavyāpi maheśvaram ||
yomipīṭhamidaṃ vakṣye sarvakāmārthasādhanam | 
āgneyāṃ vāma śaktiñca jyoṣṭhāśaktiñca naiṛte ||
raudrī ca vāyudigbhāge aiśānyāmambikāya ca | 
svakāmyapūrvadigbhāge śubhākṣī dakṣiṇe tathā ||
bhagāyai paścime bhāge cottarebhagadarpiṇi | 
bhagāni śyāmavarṇāśca svanāmādyena pūjayet || <f. 40a>
dikśakti sitavarṇaṃ tu dikśaktiraktavarṇakam |
triṇetrañcaturbhujañcaiva varadābhya hastakam || 
etarūpasamāyuktaṃ pradhānābhimukhobhavet ||
caturaśrīkṛtaṃ pīṭhaṃ vidyodākṛtavarṇakam | 
tadūrdhve ṣoḍaśadalaṃ vinyaset samavṛttakam ||
dviraṣṭāsu dalānyasya dalamadhye prapūjayet | 
kṣīravarṇanibhaṃ bījaṃ bindunādavibhūṣitam || 
padmavidyā ghṛbhājñeyaṃ tadūrdhve tu trimaṇḍalam | 
agniścaiva raviścaiva candramaṇḍalameva ca ||  
agnimūlaṃ trikoṇaṃ tu śeṣaṃ caiva suvṛttakam | 
yathā krameṇa kartavyaṃ svasvabījena pūjayet || 
trikoṇamaṇḍale madhye triliṅgaṃ surasaṃsthitam | 
triliṅgasyatu madhyetu raktāvā pūjayettataḥ ||
yonyoparimevantu romāyāmasupūjayet | 
triliṅgasyāgrake caiva hemavarṇasamaprabham ||
vākbhavantu tadūrdhve tu taruṇādityasaṃbhavam | <f.40b>
bindunādasamāyuktaṃ śakri sūkṣmaṃ parāśivam ||
śivaśaktiridaṃ bījam umārudramayaṃ tathā | 
sṛṣṭistithiśca saṃhāraṃ sarbhūtañcarācaram ||
triṇetrañcaturbhujañcaiva sukhakrīḍābhiṣekakam | 
śuddhasphaṭika saṅkāśaṃ sustanāñcasuyauvanam ||
muktābharaṇa saṃyuktā sitavastrasuśobhanā | 
sarāsanena saṃyuktā makuṭamaṇḍalahāriṇī || 
dakṣiṇe yonimudrāñca japamālatadūrdhvataḥ |
vāme cāmṛtahastā ca grāhayet pustakaṃ viduḥ || 
śaktirūpamidaṃ devīṃ sthūlasūkṣmaparaṃ śivam |
pañcāvaraṇamārgeṇa pūjayet kusumairnavaiḥ || 
pūrvācāryasupūjyantu pādukāca nameva ca |
uttarābhimukhobhūtvā sarveṣāṃ bhāvayetbudhaḥ || 
umāliṅgasthiteliṅgamūrdhvanāhaṃ tu jāyate | <f. 41a>
sarvavyāpi mahādeva saptāṇḍasyordhvago bhavet ||
śivaliṅgamitikhyātam anantaṃ pūjayet budhaḥ | 
brahmāviṣṇuścarudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ ||
tattatbhāvena pūjyaṃ tat tattanmantreṇa pūjayet | 
pūjayelliṅgamadhyastham āvahanodvāsanaṃ param ||
kṛtvā hṛt gatamañjaliṃ sakusumaṃ prāsādamantraṃ mahat
bhaktyāniṣkalagocaraṃ samarasī bhāvaṃ gatassādhakaḥ | 
dhyāyedvaṃ kramaśasya śakti kiraṇe nānde(de) tathā binduke 
niṣṭhāntaṃ kramaśasya śaktibhavane syāddevamāvāhanam || 
aṇḍāntasthaṃ yathā garbhaṃ liṅgāntasthaṃ śivaṃ tathā | 
mātṛpakṣāśrito jīvaṃ pūrṇamātmasvarūpakam || 
bhaktimantrakriyāyogātsānnidhyaṃ niṣkalaśśivaḥ |
baddhapuṣpāñjaliṃ bhūtvā śivasar bhāvabhāvitaḥ || 
trīmātrādikrameṇoccaṃ yāvannadādikaṃ vṛjet |
kāṣṭecāgniradhiṣṭopi mathanā jvalito guhaḥ || <f. 41b>
tathāca bhakti vairāgyaṃ mantrāñjali nibandhanāt |
 ālūlāgrasthitasyāgne rabhivyaktiryathātarau ||
tadvadekena cidvakti sādhakasyana bādhyate |
yathā kuṇḍagatasyāgnau vāyunā jvalitaṃ bhavet ||
tathāca liṅgamātreṇa jāyatebhagavān śivaḥ |
layaṃ gacchati bhūtānāṃ liṅgamadhye sthitaṃ bhavet ||
kāṣṭaṃ vyāpya yathā vahniḥ sthito hīnopi lipyate |
ekadeśehi kāṣṭhasthā prayogenānu lipyate ||
kāṣṭavadīpako mantrī sārdhalakṣastu vastravat |
dhyāya dhyāya navat jñeyaṃ vahnivat vidyate vibhuḥ ||
yo saudhanavarandevaṃ tadāvāhanamucyate |
vimukhīkaraṇaṃ tasya tatodvāsanamucyate ||
āvāhanodvāsanannāsti śiṣṭaliṅgaṃ viśeṣataḥ |
śivaṃ sadāśivaṃ caiva maheśomūrtayastṛdhā ||
vācyavācaka rahitaṃ vāṅmanātīta gocaram |
sarvajñānaguṇopetaṃ sarvatatvālayaṃ prabhuḥ ||
itthaṃ bhūtaśivaḥ prokto niṣkalāstviti kīrtidam | <f. 42a>  
sakalaṃ niṣkalopetam aṣṭatriṃśat kalātmakam||
kalāddhvoktāṅga saṃpūrṇo bhanāddhvotaromayuk |
varṇādhvaivatvacopetaṃ mantradhvārudhirānvitam ||
padādhvokta sirāmāsa majjāśuklāni tatvagaḥ |
sadāśivaṣaḍadhvāsyāt tasyaprāṇaśivasmṛtaḥ ||
hṛdayādyaṅga saṃpūrṇo dhyāne sakalarūpadhṛk |
niṣkalasadabhāve tu tasmāt sakalaniṣkalaḥ ||
sadāśivarūpantu pravakṣyāmi viśeṣataḥ |
kundendu sphaṭakābhāsaṃ jaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍitam ||
pañcavaktrayutaṃ teṣāṃ prativaktraṃ trilacanam |
sarvābharaṇa saṃyuktaṃ daśadorbhisamanvitam ||
śūlaṃ ca paraśuṃ khaṭgaṃ vajrābhayau ca dakṣiṇe |
pāśaṃ nāgaṃ ca ghaṇṭā ca vahniṃ varada vāmake ||
divyāmbaradharaṃ devaṃ divyapuṣpopaśobhitam |
divyagandhānuliptāṅgaṃ śāntarūpaṃ smitānanam ||
pūjākāle bhaveddhīmān bhāvayelliṅgamadhyame | <f. 42b>
indunibha pañcamukha hastadaśayuktaṃ
śūladharaṭaṅkamasi vajramabhayaṃ syāt |
pāśavaradāṅkuśamaṇirdahanavāme
śvetakamalāsana sadāśivasvarūpam ||
piṇḍikāyāṃ bhavedaivaṃ divyarūpāṃ manonmanīm |
pāśāṅkuśadharaṃ (rāṃ) devīṃ mauktikabhāṃ suyauvanām ||
suyauvanāṃ suvāsañca sustanāṃ tanumadhyamām |
kambugrīvāṃ vibhaktāṅgaṃ navaśaktyā pradāmapi ||
deviśiradakṣiṇa saduttara supādam
gomukhamathānta pratavāribhujayuktam
yoniyutamadhyagata saṃsthitaliṅgaṃ
sthāpitasadāśiva manonmani sadāśivasvarūpam ||
vāmānīlanibhāṃ devīṃ śaṅkhacakragadādharīm |
pītavarṇabhavejjyeṣṭhā padmasṛk padmalocanām ||
raudrīṃ raudranibhāṃ devīṃ triṇetrāṃ śūladhāriṇīm |
śātakumbhanibhāṃ devīṃ kālimudgaladhāriṇīm ||
kalvikarṇidhūmravarṇā pāśahastā suyauvanā | <f. 43a>
śvetābalavikaraṇi khaṭgahastā mahā balā ||
balapramathanīṃ devīṃ palāśadaṇḍadhāriṇīm |
sarvabhūtadamanī ca raktavarṇakapālinī ||
indrādīśāna paryantaṃ piṇḍikāvaraṇenyaset |
tattat svanāmamantreṇa pūjayet gandhapuṣpakaiḥ ||
ātmatatvaṃ nyaset savye vidyātatvaṃ tu vāmake |
madhyame śivatatvaṃ tu pūjayettu viśeṣataḥ ||
śivatatvaṃ rudradaivatyaṃ madyametu nyaset budhaḥ |
yajanyehati liṅgānāṃ kautukevātha saṃsthitaḥ ||
samāsīnopi liṅgādau maṇḍalasthaṇḍile'pi ca |
samāgacchati mantreṇa prārthanāvāhanaṃ smṛtam ||
āsanasmin samāsthāpya mitīcasthāpanaṃ tathā |
svāgataṃ mantrasaṃyuktaṃ sumukhīkaraṇaṃ duḥ ||
sūtrapārśvetu bāhubhyāṃ sūtrasandhistu pṛṣṭataḥ |
āvāhayettato devaṃ sadyojātena mantravit ||
sthāpayedvāmadevena aghoreṇatu sannidhi |
puruṣeṇa nirodhena īśānena tu pūjayet || <f.43b>
sadyaṃ paścimato vaktraṃ vāmadevaṃ tathettare |
dakṣiṇe'ghoravaktraṃ tu pūrve tatpuruṣānanam ||
īśānam ūrdhvavaktraṃ tu pañcavaktramitismṛtam |
īśānaṃ sphaṭikābhamūrdhva vadanaṃ yatkuṅkumābhaṃ rucā
pūrve tatpuruṣaṃ tadañjananibhaṃ yāmyetu' ghorānanam |
prācyopāvadanañca pāpasadṛśaṃ vā tathā cottare
sadyojātamukhaṃ tu paścimamidaṃ gokṣīratulyaprabham ||
brahmā vai sadyavaktraṃ tu vāmadevaṃ janārdanam |
aghoraṃ rudradaivatyaṃ tatpuruṣam īśvaraṃ tathā ||
īśānaṃ sadāśivañcaiva adhidevāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
manonmanī'ti vijñeyā sadāśivātmikā param ||
pādyaṃ dakṣiṇapādāni pratipādaṃ sakṛt sakṛt |
mukheṣvācamanaṃ dadyāt davicchinnāmbudhārayā ||
śiracchārghyaṃ dadet paścāt gandhapuṣpairyathocitam | <f. 44a>
kārayedabhiṣekaṃ tu mūrdhniśuddhodakādibhiḥ ||
agnau vā naiṛtau vā'pi sthitvā devaṃ prapūjayet  |
abhiṣekaṃ prakartavyaṃ snāpayeśśivamūrdhniṣu ||
āgatasya śivasyā'tra pādau pādyaṃ hṛdā dadet |
mukheṣvācamanaṃ dadyāt śirasyarghyaṃ tu dāpayet ||
aṣṭatriṃśat kalānyāsaṃ makuṭādi kramānyaset |
pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgaiśca vyomavyāpīṃ samuccaran ||
jalena snāpayet paścāt dadhikṣīraghṛtairapi |
nālikerodakenaiva madhunā brahmapañcakaiḥ ||
pañcāmṛtaṃ pañcagavyaṃ brahmakūrcābhiṣecanam |
hṛdā vai śālipiṣṭena karṣayelliṅga mastake ||
śivāmbhasā tu vijñāpya karṣayedāmlakena tu |
lepayedrajanīṃ paścāt snāpayet gandhavāriṇā ||
ācamanaṃ dadet paścāt pañcavaktreṣu buddhimān |
vastreṇa lepanaṃ kṛtvā liṅgaṃ pīṭhaṃ viśeṣataḥ || <f. 44b>
hṛdayena tu mantreṇa puṣpaṃ mūrdhniṣu dāpayet |
ghaṇṭāṃ tu tāḍayettatra kṣabedyavanikāntakam ||
vastropavīta gandhaṃ ca makuṭaṃ kuṇḍalaṃ tathā |
hārakeyūramālāñca hṛdayena pradāpayet ||
dhūpadīṃ hṛdādatvā nīrāñjanamataḥ param |
mukhe cakṣuṣināsābhyāṃ karṇe vakṣa dvipādayeḥ ||
pratyekaṃ praṇavākāraṃ mityete dīpalakṣaṇam |
sāyarakṣavidhiṃ vakṣye sarvaprāṇisukhāvaham ||
lokasya nayanośchiṣṭaṃ nivṛtyarthaṃ pradoṣake |
kartavyaṃ sāyarakṣāntu dhūpadīpāvasānake ||
abhiṣekaṃ śanaiḥ kṛtvā puṣpaṃ saṃgrāhya deśikaḥ |
abhyaṅgapiṣṭā'malakādi gavyaṃ
mṛdāyadugdhaṃ dadhisarpiṣañca |
madhuśca ikṣu phala nālikera
sagandhavāra(ri)snapanene śaṅkham ||
vastramāloḍya saṃyuktaṃ gandhapuṣpañca kārayet |
naivedyadhūpadīpañca śāstrapuṣpeṇa karmaṇi ||
sāyarakṣāvihīne tu bālānāṃ nāśanaṃ bhavet | <f. 45a>
liṅgāgre vā'tha bimbāgre maṇḍalaṃ caturaśrakam ||
randhrādhāre śarādhāre tvekādhāre tathaiva ca |
kṛtvātu pañcapātrāṇi saṅgrāhya hṛdivinyaset ||
prokṣayet puruṣeṇaiva dhenumudrāṃ pradarśayet |
dīpārādhaṃ tu tatkuryāt śālipiṣṭamaye na tu ||
caturaṅgula vistāramutsedhaṃ tu dvayāṅgulam |
oṣṭamadhyāṅgulaṃ proktaṃ pūrṇacandravdākṛtim ||
tanmadhyevinyaseddīpaṃ caturdikṣu ca madhyame |
goghṛtena samāyuktaṃ vinyaseddīpa pañcakam ||
varkī madhyeṣu pātreṣu nimbapātraṃ ca sarṣapam |
kārpāsabījaṃ lavaṇaṃ catuṣpātreṣu yojayet ||                             
dīpādhāraṃ tu saṃpūjya kārayeddeśikottamaḥ |
kārpāsabīja lavaṇañca dūrvā tilākṣataissarṣapanimbapatraiḥ |
tridhā paribhrāmya śivasyamūrdhni vinikṣipet bhasmaṃ ca dīpapātraiḥ || 
pūjayedhṛdayenaiva śūlīmudrāṃ pradarśayet |
agniṃ saṃpūjya vidhivat agni(*)jena biddhimān || <f. 45b>
śaṅkhadundubhi nirghoṣe stotramaṅgalavādyakaiḥ |
pādyaṃ dadyāt purāstreṇa netreṇācamanaṃ dadet ||
dīpenaiva tridhābhrāmya śikhāmantreṇa buddhimān ||
mūrdhni bhāmyaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā pādabhrāntiṃ tathaiva ca |
ājānumūrdhni paryantaṃ tribhāntiṃ bhrāmayet budhaḥ ||
divyāṇyādhaḥ krameṇaiva āghṛtyāvṛtyaliṅgake |
bhasmānaṃ dāpayet śambhoḥ dikbandhañcāstramantrataḥ ||
anāmikāṅgulāgreṇā rakṣāṃ bhasmapradāpayet |
rudrasya gaṇikābhīrvā pātrāṇi bhūsurastu vā ||
sarvatodya samāyuktaṃ balipīṭhāgrake'pi vā |
nikṣipedagni dīpaṃ tu kārayettu viśeṣataḥ ||
rājikā lavaṇañcaiva karpāsā sitasarṣapam |
dīpāgninā dahettatra agni bījena buddhimān ||
sarvopacārasaṃyuktaṃ tāmbūlaṃ ca nivedayet |
rañjayedramanāñcaiva cāmarai vyajanaṃ mukhe || <f.46a>
chatreṇopari sañcādya darpaṇaṃ darśayenmukhe |
daśamudrā prayoktavyaṃ yathoktaṃ darśapāṇiṣu ||
vajrādi padma paryantaṃ daśamudrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
nīrāñjanamidaṃ proktaṃ pañcamāvaraṇaṃ śṛṇu ||
garbha vidyā gaṇeśāśca likapālāstrime va ca |
pañcāvaraṇamākhyātaṃ sarva saṃpat karāya ca ||
brahmāṅgakānāṃ prathamaṃ pratiṃ syāt vidyeśvarāṇāñca gaṇeśvarāṇāṃ 
dipālakānāñca daśāyudhānām īśasya pañcāvaraṇa krameṇa ||
garbhāvaraṇake didvān padmamūle prapūjayet |
padmamadhye ca vidyeśān gaṇeśācca tadardhataḥ ||
lokapālāśca padmāgre astrāṇyātha prapūjayet |
pūrve tatpuruṣañcaiva aghoraṃ dakṣiṇe yajet ||
paścimetu yajet sadyaṃ vāmadevaṃ tu saumyake |
liṅgasyordhvetu īśānaṃ pūjayet gandhapuṣpakaiḥ || <f. 46b>
hṛdayaṃ pāvake pūjya naiṛtau tu śikhā yajet |
kavacaṃ vāyu deśetu śirovaiśāna deśake ||
astraṃ tu dakṣiṇe caiva īśāne nayanaṃ yajet |
śuklaṃ kuṅkumakṛṣṇaṃ ca raktaṃ śvetaṃ ca sannibham ||
brhmapañcakavarṇāsyuḥ triṇetrāśca caturbhujāḥ |
śūlaṃ kapālahastāśca abhayaṃ varadānvitam ||
śāntamīśānamityuktam anyeraudramitismṛtāḥ |
śuklaṃ pītāruṇaṃ caiva raktaṃ śyāmañca kṛṣṇakam ||
varṇādīni ṣaḍaṅgāni triṇetrāśca caturbhujāḥ |
abhayaṃ varado'petāḥ ṭṅkaśūla samanvitāḥ ||
raktaṃ śvetaṃ tathā nīlaṃ pītaṃ kṛṣṇañca kuṅkumam |
aruṇābhāñjanaprā(pra)khyaṃ kramādvidyeśavarṇakam ||
indrādīśānaparyantaṃ pūjayettu viśeṣataḥ | <f. 47a>
vidyeśāvaraṇaṃ hyevaṃ gaṇeśāvaraṇaṃ śṛṇu ||
nandīśañca mahākālaṃ bhṛṅgīśañca vināyakam |
vṛṣabhaṃ cā'tha skandaṃ devī caṇḍeśvaraṃ tathā ||
caturbhujāṃ triṇetrāñca nandīnāṃ śyāmavarṇakam |
abhayaṃ varadopetaṃ tomaraśūladhṛk(*)||
caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ tu bhṛṅgīśaḥ piṅgalaḥ prabhuḥ |
dakṣiṇebhayagaṃ kasyāt vāmevaradaśūladhṛk ||
gajānanaṃ triṇetraṃ tu kuṅkumābhaṃ caturbhujam |
pāśadantau tu savyetu vāme tvaṅkuśa laḍḍukau ||
nāga yajñopavītaṃ tu lamboṣṭaṃ tu gaṇādhipam |
vṛṣabhaṃ śvetarūpaṃ tu tīkṣṇaśṛṅgo mahābalam ||
divyarūpaṃ sulāvaṇyaṃ taptakāñcana sannibham |
raktavarṇaṃ mahāsenaṃ triṇetrāśca caturbhujāḥ ||
savye tvābhayavajrau tu varadāṅkuśa vāmake |
dvinetrāṃ dvibhujāṃ śyāmāṃ gaurī dakṣakarotpalā ||
indrādīśāna paryantaṃ pūjayettu viśeṣataḥ |
gaṇeśāvaraṇaṃ hyevaṃ lokeśāvaraṇaṃ śṛṇu || <f. 47b>
indrādyaiśāna paryantam indrādīni prapūjayet |
aiśānyāṃ brahmaṇe pūjya naiṛtyāṃ viṣṇave tathā ||
gaṇeśapālayormadhye saptamātṛśca pūjayet |
dakṣiṇe dakṣiṇe caiva vīrabhadravināyakau || 
caturthāvaraṇaṃ hyevaṃ pañcamāvaraṇaṃ śṛṇu |
vajrādi padmaparyantaṃ lokapālāyudhāsmṛtaḥ ||
vajraṃ śaktiṃ ca daṇḍaṃ ca khaṭgaṃ pāśaṃ tathāṅkuśam |
gadātriśūlaṃ cakraṃ ca padmañcaiva daśāyudhaḥ ||
 pītavidyutphalānīlaṃ nīlajīmūtavasthitam |
padmarāgaṃ tuṣārañca śabalaṃ śvetaraktakam ||
śaktirgatāstriyotatra pāśaṃ cakraṃ napuṃsakam |
śeṣaṃ ca puruṣākāram ekavaktraṃ dvihastakam ||
astrāvaraṇamākhyātaṃ dalāgrādhaḥ prapūjayet |
tattatsvanāmamantreṇa pūjayet gandhapuṣpakaiḥ || <f. 48a>
indrādīśānaparyantaṃ pūjayettu viśeṣataḥ |
pañcāvaraṇamākhyātaṃ naivedyamupadaṃśakam ||
gulakhaṇḍasamāyuktam ājyayuktaṃ dadhiplutam |
mantrānnantu kathaṃ devaṃ brūhi me tripurāntakam ||
mantraṃ rahasyamityuktaṃ madannādantamucyate |
rahasyetvodanaṃ yattu mantrānnamiti kathyate ||
tripādyaṃ parivinyasya stalikādigataṃ haviḥ |
peyaṃ lihyaṃ ca coṣyañca yukti yuktañca vinyaset ||
saṃprokṣya hṛdayenaiva śodhayitvātu bhedanā |
amṛtī kṛtya gostanyo naivedyaṃ kusumanyaset ||
naivedyaṃ dakṣahastena dadyāt pānīyamuttamam |
pañcavaktreṣu naivedyaṃ ūrdhvavakte tathāpunaḥ ||
miśraṃ kṣīrañca toyañca haṃsānāṃ pānapāyasam |
devānāṃ bhuktimantreṇa naivedyastuṣṭi tatsamam ||
kapitthasyaphalaṃ sāraṃ yāvat kuñjarabhakṣaṇam | <f. 48b>
tathā ca devatābhuktiṃ mantrenaiva nivedayet ||
hṛdācācamanaṃ datvā digbandhañca tataḥ guruḥ |
punacāramanaṃ datvā caṇḍeśāya nivedayet ||
tāmbūlaṃ dāpayet paścāt sadyena tu viśeṣataḥ |
parivāraṇabaliṃ dadyāt nityāgniṃ kārayet budhaḥ ||
marthyaloke hitārthaṃ tu nityotsamataḥ param |
arcanānavadhāssamyak pūjayettu viśeṣataḥ ||                              
parivāraṇabaliṃ dadyāt nityāgniṃ kārayet budhaḥ ||
marthyaloke hitārthaṃ tu nityotsamataḥ param |
arcanānavadhāssamyak pūjayettu viśeṣataḥ ||
dīpāntaṃ ca nivedyāntaṃ balyantaṃ kanyasatrayam |
homāntamutsavāntañca stotrāntaṃ madhyamatrayam ||
saukhyāntaṃ culukodāntaṃ prāṇāgnihotrameva ca |
uttamatrayamākhyātaṃ sāpūjaphaladāyakam ||
dīpāntamarcanaṃ proktaṃ nivedyāntaṃ prapūjanam | <f. 49a>
balyantaṃ śāntikaṃ proktaṃ phalaṃ vai kanyasatrayam ||
homantaṃ vijayaṃ proktam utsavāntaṃ tu śāntikam |
strotrāntaṃ pauṣṭikaṃ proktaṃ phalaṃ vai madhyamatrayam ||
saukhyāntaṃ muktivṛddhyarthaṃ culukāntaṃ śriyāvaham |
prāṇa(ṇā)gnihotra saphalaṃ navadhā caiva tatphalam ||
sāṅgopāṅgaṃ ca pratyaṅgaṃ pūjayet trividhaṃ smṛtam |
snānatoyaṃ ca pādyaṃ ca tathācācamanīyakam ||
vastramābharaṇaṃ caiva sugandhaṃ lepanaṃ tathā |
arghyaṃ ca mantrapuṣpaṃ ca sāṅgaṃ ceti prakīrtitam ||
upāṅgaṃ dhūpadīpaṃ syāt sāyarakṣañca bhasmanām |
 chatra cāmarakañcaiva darpaṇaṃ darśanaṃ tathā ||
nṛttagītasamāyuktam upāṅgaṃ cetikīrtitam |
naivedyabalidānaṃ ca homaṃ kṛtvā samācaret ||
nityotsavaṃ culukodañca pratyaṅgaṃ cetikīrtitam |
daśopacārān dīpānte haviṣyantaṃ hi ṣoḍaśaḥ || <f. 49b>
balyante pañcaviṃśacca ṣaṭ triṃśat dāṇḍavāntakam |
āvāhanārghyapādyaṃ ca tathaivācamanīyakam ||
snānaṃ vastropavītaṃ ca dhūpadīpavisarjanam |
daśopacārān vijñeyo dīpānte tu śivārcanam ||
āvāhanaṃ sthāpanaṃ ca pādyamācamanārghyakam |
snānaṃ vastropavītañca bhūṣaṇaṃ gandhapuṣpakaiḥ ||
dhūpadīpanivedyāni namaskāraṃ visarjanam |
ṣoḍaśairupacāraistu haviṣyante tu pūjayet ||
snānaṃ vastravilepanāñca kusumaiḥ dhūpoya dīpohaviḥ
tāmbūlaṃ mukhavāsapādyasahitaṃ saṅgīta nṛttaṃ mahan |
homo bhūtabalipradhānasahito nityotsavastotraśaḥ
ete ṣoḍaśacopacārasahitaṃ śambhossamabhyarcanam || <f. 50a>
āvāhanaṃ tu saṃsthāpya svāgataṃ ca namoditam |
ācamanārghya saṃsthāpya vastropītottarīyakam ||
bhūṣaṇaṃ gandhapuṣpañca dhūpadīpaṃ tathaiva ca |
nīrāñjanaṃ tato mudrā darśanāvaraṇārcane ||
naivedyaṃ homakarmañca balidānaṃ tathaiva ca |
stotrañjapyanamaskāram utsavānte visarjanam ||
balyante śāntikaṃ proktaṃ pañcaviṃśopacārakam |
āsanāpāsanārghyāṇi svāgatañcādhivāsanam ||
pādyamācamanaṃ snānaṃ vastrañcaivopavītakam |
bhūṣaṇaṃ gandhapuṣpañca dhūpadīpaṃ tathārghyakam ||
nīrāñjanavidhiñcaiva cāmaraṃ chatra darpaṇam |
darśanaṃ daśamudrāṇāṃ pañcāvaraṇapūjanam ||
naivedyaṃ homakarmañca balidāna japaṃ tathā |
sāmādhistotraja dhyānaṃ saṅgītaṃ vādyakaṃ tathā ||
nṛttamarghyavisarjañca ṣaṭ triṃśadyupacārakam | <f. 50b>
nṛttānte pauṣṭike hyevaṃ parārthe deva pūjanam ||
trimmadhye cetva(tsava)syānte pañcaviṃśepacārakam |
ardhayāme yajeddhīmān aṣṭāṅgenaiva pūjayet ||
pūjayettu viśeṣeṇa homaṃ balyutsavaṃ vinā |
pādyamācamanañcārghyaṃ gandhapuṣpañca dhūpakam ||
dīpañcaiva nivedyañca aṣṭāṅgañcārdhayāmake |
prākārānta vimānasthaṃ devānāṃ nityapūjanam ||
tanmūlasthāna devānāṃ sārdhanityotsavaṃ vrajet |
prātaḥ kāla śivārcanaṃ dvijahitaṃ brahmapriyaṃ pauṣṭikam 
madhyāhne śivapūjanaṃ nṛpahitaṃ viṣṇo pra(pri)yaṃ śāntikam |
sāyaṃ vaiśyahitaṃ śivasya yajanaṃ śambhopriyaṃ saukhyadam
śūdrāṇāṃ hitamardharātrikamumā prītyairbhavet kāmidam ||
saptavāra triṣu gandhārghya dhūpadīpāṣṭapuṣpikā | <f. 51a>
catupracchādanaṃ paścāt ghaṇṭāsantāḍanāvame ||
āvāhanārghyapādyeṣu snānenācamane tathā |
naivedya visarjane caiva vāri saptasuyojayet ||
arghye vilepane snāne triṣugandhaṃ syojayet |
āvāhane ca pūjānte visarjyārghyaṃ suyojayet ||
āsanārcanakāle ca pūjānte ca visarjayet |
pracchannapaṭasaṃñcanna catuṣkāleṣu pūjayet ||
pāparogi parabhṛṣṭa nāstikasśṛtidūṣataḥ (kaḥ) |
aṅgahīna durācāra dīkṣāhine viṭastathā ||
kuṇḍaśca golakaścaiva pāṣāṇḍī śipaviṣṭakaḥ |
vedavikrayakā vā'pi granthavikrayakairapi ||
duṣcarmāṅguṣṭa saṃyuktaṃ śivadravyāpahāribhiḥ |
śivadravyāpahārī ca śivadrohī ca pātakī ||
gurudravyāpahārī ca gurudrohī ca pātakī | <f. 51b>
durmukhañca durācāro mūrkhaśca gurunindakaḥ ||
pramādāddarśanaṃ kṛtvā pūjāyāṃ niṣphalam bhavet |
trikāleṣupaṭaṃ nītvā snāne dhūpe tathotsave ||
śeṣakāleṣu sarveṣu paṭena pariveṣṭayet |
athavānya prakāreṇa paṭakālaṃ viśeṣataḥ ||
pūjākāle tu naivedyaṃ puṣpālaṅkārayettataḥ |
mudrādarśana kāle tu hemaratnādi yojayet ||
evamādīni kāle tu pracchannapaṭamārabhet |
pūjārambhaṇa kāle tu pūjānte ca nivedyake ||
nityotvā (tsavā)dimānte ca mahāghaṇṭāṃ prahārayet |
yakṣarākṣasapaiśāca brahmarākṣasa bhūtakāḥ ||
gacchanti ghaṇṭaghoṣeṇa devasānnidhyame va ca |
vādyamādau padānte tu vastropavīta dānake ||
nivedyādau ca pānīyaṃ pradānānte visarjayet |
pañcāsyācamanaṃ dadyāt vidhānena yathocitam || <f. 52a>  
vāruṇaṃ saumyamāgneyaṃ vāyavyaṃ pārthivaṃ punaḥ |
vānaspatyaṃ punaṣṣaṣṭaṃ prājāpatyaṃ tu saptamam ||
aṣṭamaṃ śivapuṣpaṃ tu saṃyojyaṃ tu śivārcanam |
 vāruṇaṃ vārijaṃ jñeyaṃ saumyaṃ madhughṛtaṃ payaḥ ||
āgneyaṃ dhūpadīpaṃ tu vāyavyaṃ vyajanādikam |
vārthivaṃ kandamūlādyaṃ pānaspatyaṃ phalādikam ||
prājāpatyaṃ tadānnādyaṃ priyapuṣpaṃ tu bhāvanam |
divyaṃ prati viśeṣeṇa ghaṇṭāsantāḍyacārcayet ||
arkapaṅkajabilvaṃ ca nandyāvartaṃ ca pāṭalī |
karavīraṃ raktapadmañca nīlotpalamathāṣṭakam ||
karṇayormūrdhni karṇe ca hṛdaye nābhiguhyake |
jānunī pādayoścaiva aṣṭapuṣpaṃ suyojayet ||
ācane prathamaṃ puṣpaṃ dātavyaṃ śuddha cetasā | <f. 52b>     
mūrtidānaṃ hṛdākāryaṃ puṣpeṇaiva parenatu ||
pañcapuṣpa pradānena pañcāṅgāni prapūjayet |
śivastathāṣṭame caiva kathitācāṣṭapuṣpikā ||
ahiṃsā prathamaṃ puṣpaṃ kṣamāpuṣpaṃ dvitīyakam |
tritīyaṃ tu dayāpuṣpaṃ caturthaṃ krodhavarjitam ||
pañcamaṃ kṛtimātsaryaṃ ṣaṣṭamaṃ bhāvapuṣpakam |
saptamaṃ dhyānapuṣpaṃ tu sādhikañcāṣṭobhavet ||
ācāryo mantrayogena kriyāyogena sannidhi |
kriyāvasāne tetasyat vimuktodvāsanaṃ kuru ||
dhūpadīpe ca naivedyaṃ baliliṅgārcanakriyām |
kadācitkurute mohāt ghātanti brahmarākṣasāḥ ||
yattantreṇa samārabhya tattantreṇatu pūjayet |
pūjayedanya tantreṇa tannāmonāśayellaghuḥ ||
jagatphalakarañcaiva haviṣyantaṃtra saṃśayaḥ | <f. 53a> 
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena pūjānānyānnakārayet ||
ekācāryena kartavyam ekadevālayasthitam |
dviktrakaṃ yadi bhaveṣu rājārāṣṭraśca kartṛkam ||
amantreṇa sadāpūjā paiśācāsuravardhinī |
vyādhitaskara corāddyairnāśanaṃ tu sadā bhavet ||
amantram arcanaṃ proktaṃ akālenatu pūjanam |
grāmanāśañca durbhikṣaṃ pūjakānāṃ vinaśyati ||
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena samantreṇaiva pūjayet |
mantraṃ ca dvividhaṃ jñeyaṃ vaidikaṃ tāntrikaṃ tathā ||
dakṣiṇaṃ trividhaṃ tantraṃ mantraṃ mantravidhānataḥ |
vaidikaṃ tāntrikaṃ caiva tathā vaidika tāntrikam ||
vaidikairvaidikairmantraiḥ tāntrikaistāntrikaṃ tathā |
vaidikaṃ tāntrikaṃ caiva mantravaidikatāntrikam || <f. 53b>
kevalaṃ tāntrikaṃ vāmaṃ yāmalaṃ ca tridhā bhavet |
vaidikaṃ cāpi sammiśraṃ dakṣiṇe yāmale'pi ca ||
mudrairmantrairkriyābhedaiḥ vāmayāmalatāntrikam |
dakṣiṇāgamakarmāṇi kuryāddakṣiṇapāṇinā ||
vāmatantrokta karmāṇi vāmahastena pāṇinā |
pūjābhedaṃ samākhyātaṃ naivedyānāṃ vidhiṃ śṛṇu ||
bhūmiśuddhaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā prokṣayet hṛdayenatu |
mahisamyak paristīrya vastreṇoparichādayet ||
tasyordhve kadalīpatraṃ pūrvāgraścottarāgrakam |
paristaredviśeṣeṇa bhūtenaivābhighārayet ||
haviṣyantu tridhākṛtvā dvibhāgaṃ tu nivedayet |
ekaṃ tu pātraśeṣaṃ syāt upadaṃśājyasūpakān ||
dadhitāmbūlakaṃ caiva prabhūtañca parigrahet |
astraṃ diśāsu vinyasya astramudrā samanvitam ||
pādayordevadevāya hṛdayenatu deśikaḥ | <f. 54a> 
bhakṣyaṃ bhojyannapānañca coṣyaṃ lehyaṃ tathaiva ca ||
hastodvaktana puṣpañca kṛtvācācamanaṃ dadet |
naivedyānāṃ vidhiñcaiva pānīyānāṃ vidhiṃ śṛṇu ||
nave tāmre nibhe śuddhe mṛdbhāṇḍe pūrayejjalam |
nadyāṃ sarasi kūpe ca pānīyamuktamādayaḥ ||
vastrapūtaṃ suśītaṃ syāt elādi parisevitam |
anena vidhināyuktaṃ pānīyaṃ dāpayet hṛdā ||
ācamanaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā caṇḍeśāya pradāpayet |
akṣadvayapramāṇaṃ tu balidānaṃ prakīrtitam ||
dvārasya dakṣiṇe pārśve nandīśāya pradāpayet |
dvārasya vāma pārśvetu mahākālaṃ pradāpayet ||
vṛṣabhāya tato datvā purato'gnau tu pāvake |
yāmye mātṛgaṇānāṃ tu niṛtautu yathā punaḥ || <f. 54b>
skandāyavāruṇebhāge jyeṣṭhāyai vāyu gocare |
durgāyai somadirbhāge (?)śānyāṃ bhāskarāya ca ||
tataḥ purasthito pīṭhe baliṃ dadyāt viśeṣataḥ |
yakṣarākṣasapaiśāca bhūtagandharvakinnarāḥ ||
pitṛdānava nāgāśca brahmādyaiśānamontakam |
praṇavādi caturthyantaṃ svanāmapada madhyamam ||
svāhāntaṃ balinirdeśaṃ sarvebhya iti yojayet |
punarācamanaṃ datvā mukhavāsasamanvitam ||
lavaṅgacūrṇakarpūraṃ laghudhaṇṭāsya cūrṇakam |
phalatrayāṇi pūrṇaṃ hi sasaṅgrāhyaṃ samācaret ||
bhojanānte dadeddhīmān mukhavāsaṃ śivapra(pri)yam |
tāmbūlaṃ dāpayet śambho prasthaṃ pratyekaśaḥ phalam ||
phalāścaturguṇaṃ patraṃ sajihvāṇa ca varjitam |
aśvacūrṇasamāyuktaṃ kramukasya phalānvitam ||
tatbhinnatailasammiśraṃ dāpayettu śivāya ca | <f. 55a>
nityamevaṃ samākhyātaṃ kārayettu vicakṣaṇaḥ ||
dadeścalasya caṇḍassya sakalānāṃ nivedyakam |
liṅge nivedikaṃ(taṃ) yattat nirmālyamitikīrtidam ||
bhūmau vahnau jalevāpi gokulānāṃ visarjayet |
nirmālyaṃ nirmalaṃ śuddhaṃ nirmalātmā parigraham ||
kāyasya malabandhatvāt nirmālyaṃ tu nabhojayet |
bhuktaṃ cettu pramādāttu atikṛcchraṃ samācaret ||
pramādāllughranaṃ tatra prājāpatyaṃ caret sudhīḥ |
sparśane pāṇipādau ca prakṣālyācamanaṃ kuru ||
āpohiṣṭe'ti mantreṇa prokṣayecchuddhavāriṇā |
pratimānāñca sarveṣāṃ nirmālyañca nivedakam ||
bhojyaṃ tu parivārāṇāmanyeṣāñca na bhojyatum |
gaṇeśasyatu naivedyaṃ sarveṣāṃ bhojyamucyate ||
senāpatī ca naivedyaṃ bhojyaṃ caiva jayārthinām |
durgāyāñca nivedyānnaṃ bhojyamārogya vardhanam ||
jyeṣṭhāyāñca nivedyānnaṃ bhojyaṃ tat jīvavardhanam | <f. 55b>   
abhojyaṃ bhānubhaktānāṃ naivedyaṃ bhāskarasya tu ||
anyeṣāṃ caiva sarveṣāṃ bhojyaṃ naivedyakaṃ caret |
naivedyaṃ tu mahāmopuṃ bhojyā putravivardhanam ||
brahmaṇānāmabhojyaṃ tu naivedyamadanasyatu |
brahmaṇānāṃ tu bhojyaṃ hi brahmaṇasya nivedikam ||
nivedyaṃ lokapālānāmārogyaṃ kurute sadā |
manmathasya nivedyaṃ taṃ sarveṣāṃ bhojyamucyate ||
prāyaścittanimittaṃ tat prājāpatyādhikaṃ śṛṇu |
agniyāstriyahaṃ prātaḥ sadyamantraṃ tato japet ||
anagniyāstriyahaṃ sāye varmamantrajapettataḥ |
pañcamantrajapetyāhaṃ navamadyārcayācitam ||
triyahaṃ caiva nāgnīyāt ataḥ paraṃ viśeṣataḥ |
sadāśivaṃ tato dhyātvā vaktramantraṃ japettataḥ ||
japet sahasra saṅkhyātu dinaṃ pratidinaṃ prati | <f. 56a>
prājāpatyamidaṃ proktaṃ sarvapāpanikṛntanam ||
napānāmagnimantraṃ tu bhuñjīyāt guhyakaṃ japet |
|| hariḥ om ||
pañcatryahantu nagnīyāt sahasra hṛdayān japet ||
atikṛcchramidaṃ proktaṃ dinaṃ(?)prati japettataḥ |
saptajanmakṛtaṃ pāpam anyenaiva viśuddhyati ||
prājāpatyamidaṃ proktaṃ nityāgnināṃ vidhiṃ śṛṇu | 
āgneyāṃ sthāpayedagniṃ vidhinā deśikottamaḥ ||
caturaśraṃ tu vṛttaṃ vā mekhalatrayasaṃyutam |
rakta(/)tnamātraṃ tu vistāraṃ tanmānaṃ balimucyate ||
paścime dakṣiṇe vāpi yonimaśvatthapatravat |
kuṇḍevāsthāpayedagnim avicchinnaṃ tu rakṣayet ||
yāvanmūlopacāraistu dāvadagniṃ supūjayet |
liṅgasthaṃ pūjayettatra vahnisthaṃ haviṣāhutiḥ ||
trikālaṃ vaikakālaṃ vā agniṃ saṃpūjayet guruḥ |
śodhanaṃ mārjanaṃ tatra gomayālepanaṃ kramāt ||
aghorāstreṇa mantreṇa śodhayettu viśeṣataḥ |
gandhaiḥ puṣpaiḥ tathā dhūpaiḥ dīpairagniṃ tu pūjayet ||
darbhaiḥ paristaredadbhiḥ pariśecamathācaret |
ājyaṃ hutvā hṛdā mantri vyāhṛtiṃ juhuyāt kramāt || <f. 56b>
praṇavenatu mantreṇa hutvā ṣoḍaśaṃ hunet |
caruṃ hutvā tadantetu vyāhṛtiṃ caiva hūyate ||
brahmāṅgāni tato hutvā spiṣṭāntaṃ hīna kārayet |
praṇitāghārasamidha brahmakūrcaṃ samarcayet ||
nityāgnināṃ vidhiñcaiva mudrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu |
mudaṃ karoti devānāṃ drāvayat (a)surānstathā ||
modanādrāvaṇātcceṣāṃ mudrāyāṃ parikīrtitam |
liṅgamudrānamaskāra tālākhyāśaṅkhamudrikā ||
surabhimukulicaiva bapāhī niṣuraṃ tathā |
bījākhyāpañcamudrāca dravyamudrāgipāpyakam ||
saṃhāramudrayā caiva sadāśivākhyamudrikā |
āsanīyamaheśāmvyā vajrādi daśamudrikā ||
ṭaṅkamudrā mahāmudrā sādākhyācāstramudrikā |
caramudrā cāpamudrā dvātriṃśat parikīrtitāḥ ||
sakalārādhanaṃ vakṣye saṃkṣepāt śṛṇu ṣaṇmukha |
calañcalācalañcaiva acalañcatridhābhavet ||
calaṃ dhātumayaṃ jñeyaṃ bhitticitrapaṭaṃ tathā |
mṛṇmayecitrayuktena paṭe vā bhitticitrake ||
teṣu devaṃ yajesnānaṃ sarvasaṃpat karāvaham |
liṅgamudreca vikhyātaṃ pracchinnetu pradarśayet ||
sanniveśya hṛdisthāne namaskāreticocyate | <f. 57a>
hastābhyāṃ tāḍayettāṃ tu mudrāṃ kuryāttu śodhayet ||
eṣāhi śaṅkhamudrātu snānakāle pradarśayet |
kṛtvā papāhinīkhyātā kuryādāvāhane tataḥ ||
sannidhakhyaṃ viśeṣeṇa sannirodhana kālaka |
bījamudrā tadākhyātaṃ darśayecciti kalpane ||
mudrāpañcamukhī caiva darśayedvaktrakarmaṇi |
dravyamudrābhavetteṣāṃ dravyābhāve pradarśayet ||
śivākhyāsthāpane kāle darśayeddevasannidhau |
muṣṭimudrāgatābaddhā vāsaṃhṛtau sahṛtauparaḥ ||
āpanākhyā tadākuryāt āsanetu pradarśayet |
mahāśākhyā tālamudrā pratimāntatu darśayet ||
vajrādi daśamudrāntaṃ bhāvayeddaśahastake |
ṭaṅkamudrā mahāmudrā bhaveddeṣāṃ sakuñcitam ||
dhanumudrā bhavetteṣāṃ sarvaśatṛvināśanam |
mudrākramaṃ samākhyātaṃ yugma yugma vibhāgaśaḥ ||
tarpaṇāñjali mudrāṇāṃ karaṇāñcāvakuṇṭhanam |
pādyamācamanaivedyaṃ prādhānañcābhiṣecaram ||
vastrābharaṇamālādi bhūṣaṇaṃ hastayugmataḥ |
danāni darśanādīni prokṣaṇañconmukhenatu || <f. 57b> 
arghyodakāñjalīdānaṃ tarpaṇāvāhanādikam |
hastābhyāṃ samukhāhyāṃ tu vidhinākārayet budhaḥ ||
dravyadevaṃ tu mantrāṇāṃ vidyāmbhamaspi prokṣaṇam |
adhomukhena hastena tathā mṛgātrāvakuṇṭhanam ||
śayanāsana saṅkalpya agnyādhānaṃ ca kalpayet |
hutamaṃ sukṣaṇañcāpi gandhapuṣpārghyadānakam ||
pratiṣṭhājapa saṅkhyātaṃ balidānādikaṃ tathā |
tryaṃbakena hastena dadrāhyamabhiṣecanam ||
madhyamānāmikāṅgulyaiḥ tribhireva samāyutam |
dravyadevatamantrāṇi nyasedgandhādi dāpayet ||
ju(hu)yāt samidhājyābhyāṃ prokṣayettu yathā vidhiḥ |
ūrdhvebhyukṣaṇamādāya athobhyukṣaṇamukṣaṇam ||
triḥ pañcagavyatoyena nāmamantrayutaiḥ kuṇaiḥ |
anuktamanyato yasmāt śivaśāstreṣu bhāṣitam ||
aṅgaprayogamanviṣya evamedeśikottamaḥ |
mudrākramaṃ samākhyātaṃ sakalārādhanaṃ śṛṇu ||
sakalārādhanaṃ vakṣye saṃkṣepāt śṛṇu ṣaṇmukhā |
calañcalācalañcaiva acalañcatridhābhavet ||
calaṃ dhātumayaṃ jñeyaṃ railañcalācalaṃ smṛtam |
acalaṃ mṛṇmayaṃ jñeyaṃ bhitticitrapaṭaṃ tathā ||
mṛṇmayecitra yuktena paṭevā bhitti citrake |
teṣu devaṃ yajessnānaṃ vastrābharaṇairpurā || <f. 58a>
lohesāndramṛdaṃ pāyayajet sarvopacārakaiḥ |
paṭasthabhitticitrasya citrayuktophalasyatu ||
mṛṇmayāsya viśeṣeṇa karmārcāyasahārciyet |
karmārcā bāhupīṭhe vā kuryānmaṇimayārcanam ||           
jānvantaṃ vāpi nābhyantaṃ karmārcā pratimodayaḥ |
citrahīne śilāyāntu lohastvādvāvisarjayet ||
proktākarmārcanā yasyaproktamantrāt kṛtārcane |
triḥ prakṛtārcanaṃ tatra karmārcāyāntu kārayet ||
ādāyā prokṣaṇaṃ khyātā avakto lohakarmaṇi |
sthāpitaṃ kevalaṃ yatra parivārādibhiryutam ||
tatrasarvopacāraistu kartavyaṃ yajanākramāt |
kevalājyāścabimbāśca sthāpitāśca viśeṣataḥ ||
bhaviṣyante yajeddhīmān parivārādikaṃ vinā |
bimbaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā yathā bimbātu sārataḥ ||
sarvasandhyārcitaṃ mālā apanīya hṛdātataḥ |
saṃśoddhyāśramayaṃ bimbaṃ vaktrapīṭhena vā yutam ||
kuśairvāśodhayeddhīmān chatrahāsaṃ tathaiva ca |
yathāvarṇitalaiyantu  kevalaṃ cet jalenatu ||
rātricūrṇaṃ tu sauvarṇaṃ rajataṃ lavaṇena tu |
tāmrapātreṇa vṛddhisyāt karasaṃbhasmena śuddhyati ||
tathālohaja bimbāni snāpyaṃ parvaṇi parvaṇi | <f. 58b> 
nityaṃ snānaṃ vinā lohe snāpyaṃ parvaṇi parvaṇi ||
puṣpaṃ śirasi vinyasya kalpayedāsanadvayam |
dharmādīni ca koṇeṣu pādāsaṅkalpya deśikaḥ ||
adharmādīni cakrādi sakalāṃ vinyaset kramāt |
guṇatrayena saṃchādya madhyametu hariṃ yajet ||
tasyordhve kalamānyastvā sāṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam |
tanmadhye vinyaseddevam aṣṭatriṃśatkalāmayam ||
yadyat karmayutaṃ tasmāt karmārcā vā samārabhet |
sadyenāvāhayeddevaṃ vinyasedguhyakena tu ||
sannirodhamaghoreṇa puruṣeṇatu sannidhim |
hṛdayenatu mantreṇa śirasyārghyaṃ tu nikṣipet ||
pādyamācamanārghyañca dāpayedhṛdayena tu |
pañcabrahma ṣaḍaṅgaiśca sakaṃsyādabhiṣecanam ||
anādrayāṣṭaghoreṇa kuśāyāprokṣayet budhaḥ |
ataḥ paraṃ bhūṣaṇañcaiva upavītañca darpaṇam ||
īśānena pradātavyaṃ pādaṃ sadyena dāpayet |
mālātu śirasā dadyāt dhūpaṃ tatpuruṣeṇatu ||
dīpaṃ vai netramantreṇa gaurī vāmena yojayet |
gaṅgāñca pūrvadidbhāge dakṣiṇetu vināyakam || <f. 59a>
senāpatī tu pāyānyā koṣṇeṣvanyatraset kramāt |
devasyatveti mantreṇa naivedyaṃ tu pradāpayet ||
hṛdācācamanaṃ datvā nirmālyaṃ tu visarjayet |
tāmbūlaṃ dāpayeddhīmān mukhavāsa samanvitam ||
sakalārādhanaṃ proktaṃ praṇavādi ṛṣiṃ śṛṇu |
oṃkārasya svarodāntaṃ ṛṣi brahmāditāmarāḥ |
chandodevīca gāyatrī paramātmāca devatā ||
sadyojātasya mantrasya brahmatatrādhidevatā |
gāyatrī chanda ityukto ṛṣirgotama eva ca ||
vāmadevasya mantrasya viṣṇustatrādhidevatāḥ |
anuṣṭup chandakalpaśca atriyaṃ ṛṣibhistathā ||
aghoramantrasvarūpeṇa rudrāstatrādhidevatāḥ |
triṣṭupacchandasya ityukto savāmitra ṛṣistathā ||
puruṣomantradevasya maheśasyādhidevatāḥ |
bṛhaspatiśchanda ityukto ṛṣiṃ śātāla saṃyutaḥ ||
īśānamantrarūpañca śivastatrādhidevatāḥ |
jagatī chanda ityukto bhāradvājo ṛṣistathā ||
sādākhyā rūpamevantu pañcabrahmamayaṃ tathā |
atha vakṣye viśeṣeṇa nityotsava vidhiṃ śṛṇu|| <f. 59b>
hāṭakena rūtye(pye)na vā kṛtaṃ tāmrakena karakanti vismṛtam|
tālamātravisṛtaṃ sakarṇikaṃ sāṅgulocchramathāṣṭapālakam|| 
evaṃ pātraṃ tu saṃgṛhya anyaso maṇṭapottare|
pra(prā)tarmadhyāhnasāyāhne puṣpānyā(*) samāyutam || 
kanyasestviti vikhyātaṃ dvikālañcānnaliṅgakam |
sāyecaivāgyaliṅgyaṃ(ṅgaṃ) tu madhyamañceti kīrtitam ||
trikālañcānna liṅgaṃ tu uttamañceti kīrtitam | 
ādityāṅgulamutsedhaṃ dviguṇannāhamucyate ||
anyaṃ pakṣāṅgulaṃ tāraṃ gandhamālyairalaṅkṛtam |
talliṅgaṃ tu tathā pūjya raudraṃ pāśupataṃ tathā ||
candraśekharasya 
caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca śikhākoṭi samujvalam |
sarvalakṣaṇa saṃyuktaṃ raudradraṣṭi samāyutam ||
gṛhītvā śūladaṇḍāgraṃ vāmena kaṭakena tu |
triśūlaṃ daṇḍamūlaṃ tu savyahastena muṣṭinā ||
adhomukhaṃ tu muṣṭiṃ syāt kaṭakañcordhva vaktrakam |
dakṣiṇe cākṣamālāñca vāmahastena pāśadhṛk ||
samagasthānakaṃ kṛtvā pūrvoktena pramāṇataḥ |
astrarājanamevaṃ tu kārayettu vicakṣaṇaḥ ||
sadyenāvāhayeddevaṃ vāmena sthāpitaṃ bhavet |
aghoreṇatu sānnidhya puruṣeṇatu pūjayet || <f. 60a>
darśayedastrama(mu)drāñca namaskārākhyakaṃ tathā |
ugrendro draṣināthāya pūjayedinduśekharā ||
ṛjvāgata sti(sthi)taṃ devaṃ kṛṣṇāparaśu saṃyutam | 
varadābhayahastaṃ tu jaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍitam ||
dvīpacarmāmbaradharaṃ saumyadṛṣṭismitānanam | 
induśekharamūrtaṃ vā astramūrtiṃ tathaiva ca ||
pratimākāramūrtiṃ vā yajelliṅge tadānyakam |
pādukārādhanaṃ kuryāt saṃkṣepāt śṛṇu ṣaṇmukha ||
pādukā vṛṣadaivatyaṃ pūjayedvṛṣamantrataḥ |
lokapālān samabhyarcya pādukāpratimeva ca ||
upacārāṇi sarvāṇi vṛṣagāyatrimantrataḥ |
vaṣecaivamabhāvate kalahebandhamārute ||
kevalaṃ cāstrarājānāṃ liṅgastāvṛta pūjanā |
pāśupade(te)na cātyarthaṃ hṛdayenāṣṭaśataṃ hunet ||
paricārau samāhūya soṣṇīṣaṃ sottarīyakam |
sarvalakṣaṇa saṃpannaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam ||
pavitrapāṇināssarve gandhamālyairalaṅkṛtam |
tayormūrdhni nyaselliṅgaṃ pratimāñca viśeṣataḥ ||
vitānaśchatrasaṃyuktaṃ piścha cāmara saṃyutam | <f. 60b>
sarvātodya samāyuktaṃ nṛttageya samākulam ||
nānādīpaissamāyuktaṃ nānābhaktajanairyutam |
pūrvāhne brahmaṇaprīti madhyāhne śivamūrtinaḥ ||
vṛṣa prītikaraṃ rātrau tri kṛtvātu pradakṣiṇam |
nayeccamūrdhni purataḥ tadantevastathaiva ca || 
prathamaṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā bhṛṅgiṇī tālasaṃyutam | 
parivāra dvitīyaṃ tu pradakṣiṇamathācaret ||
vṛṣasya vṛṣatālaṃ tu āgneyā bhṛṅgiṇī tathā |
mātṛṇā jharjharīvādyā vighneśasyatu kekarī ||
ṣaṇmukhasyo(syā)t ghaṭaṃ caiva jyeṣṭhāyāṃ kuñcitālakam |
taṭaprahāradurgāyāṃ viṣamantyanna caṇḍake ||
gāndhāraṃpūrvakālestraṃ badhyāvaṇañca kauśikam |
bhṛṅgīpañcamamallatāla sahitaṃ śrīkāmarasauvanam ||
take(kke)śīvilitālayuktasahitāmeṇāyasnatu karāgomahā 
gopure vādyaniśśabdaṃ śaṅkhaghoṣa samanvitam | 
tataḥ purasthite pīṭhe triḥ kṛtvātu pradakṣiṇam ||
sarvadevāśritaṃ dhāmaṃ balipīṭhaṃ viśeṣataḥ |
bhūrbhuvastrilokānāṃ valārthīva badamvaram ||
surṛṣibhirmanuṣyāṇāṃ carācarāṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ | <f. 61a>
utpannaṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ baladaṃ balirucyate ||
trilokapradakṣiṇārthāya śivadhāmapradakṣiṇam | 
bhūḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ pūrvaṃ dvitīyaṃ bhuvapradakṣiṇam ||
suvaṇḍa pradakṣiṇaṃ tritīyaṃ tu pradakṣiṇamahāphalam |
bhūmyantarikṣasvargāṇāṃ rakṣārthaṃ bhuvanaśśivaḥ ||
ālayassarvadevānāṃ mūlādhāramitismṛtam |
kurvan pradakṣiṇaṃ śambhuṃ jagadrakṣārthakāraṇam ||
devaiśca dānavairyakṣarākṣasaiśca munīṣibhiḥ |
siddhaiśca cāraṇaiścaiva sadāsevyaṃ śivāya ve(vai) ||
mahānāṃ balipīṭhaṃ tu devānāmāśritaṃ tataḥ |
balibhramaṇakāleṣu parivārārcaneṣu ca ||
pradakṣaṇatriyāyāntu chāyālaṅghanamiṣyate |
śambaraṃ balipīṭhaṃ tu praviśyābhyantare tataḥ ||
indrasya samatālaṃ tu āgnebaddhāvaṇaṃ bhavet |
yamasya bhṛṅgiṇītālaṃ naiṛtyāṃ mallatālakam || <f. 61b>
vāruṇyāṃ navatālaṃ tu vāyavyāṃ calitālakam |
saumyetu kauśikīproktam īśānyāṃ ḍhakarī tathā ||
baliliṅgaṃ prakartavyaṃ pūrvokta vidhinā saha |
pradakṣiṇaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā praviśedālayaṃ prati || 
dvāradeśaṃ samāśritya pādaprakṣālaṇaṃ kuru |
praviśedālayaṃ paścāt vinyaset pūrva deśike ||
liṅgāddevaṃ samādāya mūlaliṅgaṃ tu vinyaset |
tato prahārañcaṇḍāya caṇḍamantreṇa dāpayet ||
balivādyaṃ tataśṛtvā piśācā brahmarākṣasāḥ|
grāmabāhya tato gatvā dhanadhānya samṛddhidam ||
evaṃ nityotsavaṃ kṛtvā japalakṣaṇamucyate |
aṅgulyājapa saṅkhyātam ekamekaṃ varānane ||
rekhādaṣṭaguṇaṃ vidyāt putradīpa phalerdaśa |
śataṃ vā śaṃkhamuṇibhiḥ pravālastu sahasrakam ||
sphaṭikā daśasāhasraṃ mauktikairlakṣamucyate |
padmākṣerdaśalakṣaṃ tu svarṇaiḥ koṭyekamucyate || <f. 62a>
daśakoṭikuśagranthi japena satataṃ naraḥ |
śrīrudrākṣajapenaiva anantaṃ guṇadaṃ phalam ||
rudrākṣaṃ tu japaṃ vidyāt japasaṅkhā na vidyate |
samāsirjapa saṃyuktaṃ stotramantramanantaram ||
pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgaiśca vyomavyāpi trayambakam |
yathāśakti japaṃ kuryāt trikṛtvātu pradakṣiṇam ||
bharatokta pramāṇena tāṇḍavaṃ caiva geyakam |
japalakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ culukodamathaśṛṇu ||
guhyādi guhyage(go)ptatvaṃ gṛhaṇeṣu kṛtaṃ japam |
siddhirbhavatume yena tvatprasādātvayistite ||
yatkiñcit karma hedeva sadā sukṛta duṣkṛtam |
tanmeśivapadastasya bhuṅkṣakṣapaya śaṅkara ||
śivodātā śivobhaktā śivassarvamidaṃ jagat |
śivoyajati sarvatra yarguvat sohamevatu ||
añjalī dakṣiṇaṃ hastaṃ kuñcitaṃ caturaṅgulam |
puṣpaṃ vāri gṛhītvātu kaniṣṭhā śrāvayedbudhaḥ ||
culukodakaṃ samākhyātaṃ svātmāna pādakañjalam | <f. 62b>
bhāskaro hṛdayamārabhya yāvadvebhāskarodayā ||
saptārdha ghaṭikāmāno yāmoyaṃ siddirucyate |
ṣaṣṭiśvāso haveprāṇaḥ tat ṣaṣṭi ghaṭikā bhavet ||
ghaṭikā ṣaṣṭyahorātram aṣṭasandhyaṃ tu mucyate |
aṣṭasandhyaṃ tu yā pūjā sā pūjā uttamottamā ||
sapta ṣaṭ bhūtavedāgni yagmedupraharorihā |
uttamādi trayeṇaiva pūjā kanyāvidhirbhavet ||
pūjārambhāstu nṛtyāntaṃ kuryāt sandhyāpradānakam |
sandhyādi(dhi)kramaṇāddoṣo manañcettu na doṣabhāk ||
gurupādukapūjā ca vidhike kā prakīrtitāḥ |
laghūpacāra sandhyā yā nyūnañcattu nadoṣabhāk ||
yayā saṃbhavakāletu tathā saṃbhava nāḍikā |
ātmārtha yajanaṃ kuryāt yathāśaktyānurodhakān ||
ghaṭikādvau bhavet snānaṃ ghaṭikaikārcanaṃ bhavet |
ghaṭikārdhā nivedyaṃ tu balidānaṃ tu tatsamam ||
nityāgnikāryamardhaṃ ca nityotsavaṃ vi(dvi)nāḍikā |
tāṇḍavam ekanāḍīsyāt sandhyā prati suyojayet || <f. 63a>
bhāskarodayamārabhya yāvattu daśanāḍikā |
prātaḥ kālamidaṃ proktaṃ pūrvāhnamidamucyate ||
pūrvāhnantaṃ samārabhya yāvattu daśanāḍikā |
madhyāhnamiti vijñeyamaparāhnamihocyate ||
madhyāhnābhi samārabhya yāvattu daśanāḍikā |
aparāhnamidaṃ jñeyaṃ sāyaṃ kālamemihocyate ||
astamānaṃ samārabhya āhṛtadvaya nāḍikā |
pradoṣamitivijñeyam ardhayāmaṃ tataḥ śṛṇu |
pradoṣāntaṃ samārabhya tripādena trināḍikā ||
ardhayāmamidaṃ proktam ardharātrimihocyate |
ardhayāmaṃ tadārabhya yāvattu daśanāḍikā ||
ardharātramidaṃproktaṃ rātrāntakamihocyate |
bhāskarasyodayāt pūrve tripādena trināḍikam ||
rātrāntikamidaṃ proktaṃ jñātvaivaṃ sarvamācaret | <f. 63b>
jalasaṅgrahaṇaṃ puṣpaṃ saṅgrahaṃ yajanaṃ tathā |
padāyadeva kartavyaṃ rātrānte vā jalaṃ gṛhet ||
devatā sthāpanaṃ tīrthaṃ prātaḥ kāle samācaret |
pra(prā)taḥ kālantamārabhya yāvat kāśikanāḍikā ||
tāvatvaṃ viprakartavyaṃ tīrthakāryaṃ samācaret |
aṅkurārpaṇa sarvaṃ tu utsavasyādhivāsanam ||
sāye ca prārabheddhīmān rakṣāsūtraprabandhanam |
sthāpane prokṣaṇecaiva garbhanyāse tathaiva ca ||
adhivāsādikaṃ sarvaṃ kautukañcaiva kārayet |
(---) sarvadevapriyārthakam ||
kuryāt pañcamahāśabdaṃ tadā'śubha nivartaye |
paścimadvāraharmye tu kiñcit bhedaṃ śivārcanam ||
dvārasya dakṣiṇe pārśve nandīśaṃ narmadā yajet |
dvārasya vāma pārśvetu vijayaṃ sindhumarcayet ||
nandyādi dvārapālānāṃ pūrvavat parikalpayet| <f. 64a>
paścime vṛṣabhaṃ pūjya skandaṃ pūrvetu pūjayet ||
parivāraṃ yajettatra vṛṣā vighneśvaraṃ tathā |
upacārāṇi sarvāṇi sadyavaktre pradāpayet ||
āsanāvaraṇādīni pūrvavat parikalpayet |
ātmārthañca parārthañca evaṃ sandhyārcitaṃ śivam ||
aśakta kriyate pūjyaṃ tasya puṇyaphalaṃ śṛṇu |
dhānyā yaśaskarāñcāyurvardhanaṃ puṣṭivardhanam ||
adṛṣṭamuktidaṃ sarvaṃ dānayajñaphalapradam |
kulaikaviṃśamuddhṛtya śivaloka mahīyate ||
śivasya paripūrṇasya kīnnāmatkriyate jane |
yatkṛtaṃ śivabhaktānāṃ tacchivasya kṛtaṃ bhavet ||
|| [iti vātula tantre sahastrasaṃhitāyā nityārcana paṭalaḥ] ||
|| hariḥ om ||
[śrīvaśrīkaṇṭhapparāya svahasta likhitaṃ vāsanārcanai saṃpūrṇam]
|| hariḥ om ||

